        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: 526110003000\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: Liebert\r\nProduct Line: itON\r\nProduct Model: ITON CX 1000 VA\r\nProduct Name: ITON CX UPS 1000VA/360W 230V Line Interactive AVR\r\nMarketing Information: The Vertiv Liebert&reg; ITON&trade; 600VA CX is a cost-effective, line-interactive uninterruptible power supply unit that offers power protection and battery backup for home or small office computers and other critical electronic equipment. Equipped with two 7Ah batteries, it helps ensure reliable performance even during power disruptions. This generator-compatible UPS has an AVR for voltage stabilization, and a cold start function for emergency power, making it a dependable solution for maintaining your devices' uptime.\r\nProduct Type: Line-interactive UPS\r\nAVR: Yes\r\nReceptacle Type: Indian Socket\r\nReceptacle Detail: 4 x Indian socket\r\nDataline Protection: No\r\nProtection Type: Fuse, Brownout, Output Short Circuit, RFI, Surge, Under Voltage, Black Out, Power Failure, Output Over Voltage, Over Charge, Noise, Short Circuit, Thermal Overload, Deep Discharge, Soft Start, Over Temperature, Over Loading, Inrush Current, EMI, AC Noise, Sag, Electric Shock, Lightning, Temperature, Transient, Discharge, Quad, Output Over Current, Low Battery, High/Low Voltage, Over Current, Electronic Current Limit, Under Current, Line Noise, Over Voltage, Spike, AC Surge, Over Power, Excessive Low Battery\r\nOverload Protection: Yes\r\nBypass Switch: No\r\nTransfer Time: 6 ms\r\nPhase: Single Phase\r\nApplication/Usage: Desktop Computer, Electronic Equipment, Home, Office, IT Equipment, Network Bridge, Network Hub, Router, POS Terminal, Workstation, Mission Critical Equipment\r\nLoad Capacity (VA): 1 kVA\r\nLoad Capacity (Watt): 600 W\r\nInput Voltage: 230 V AC\r\nOutput Voltage: 230 V AC\r\nWaveform Type: Simulated Sine Wave\r\nStatus Indicators: LEDs\r\nSerial Port: No\r\nVGA: No\r\nModem (RJ-11): No\r\nNetwork (RJ-45): No\r\nUSB: No\r\nBackup/Run Time (Full Load): 1 Minute\r\nBackup/Run Time (Half Load): 10 Minute\r\nHot Swappable: No\r\nHeight: 15.80 cm (6.22\")\r\nWidth: 13.97 cm (5.50\")\r\nDepth: 36.83 cm (14.50\")\r\nRack Height: 4U\r\nForm Factor: Tower\r\nWeight (Approximate): 9.98 kg\r\nEnergy Star: No\r\nCountry of Origin: China\r\nTAA Compliant: No\r\nEnvironmentally Friendly: No\r\nLimited Warranty: 1 Year",
