        "name": "Vertiv Liebert GXT MT+ CX UPS | 1kVA | SB | Standard Run | Double Conversion",
        "fullDescription": "Vertiv Liebert GXT MT+ CX UPS | 1kVA | SB | Standard Run | Double Conversion - Efficient Robust UPS for Critical Applications | Galvonic isolation | Hot standby | Extended runtime | LCD Screen | Ultra Wide Input Voltage Range | Total isolation",
        "longDesc": "Efficient Robust UPS for Critical Applications | Galvonic isolation | Hot standby | Extended runtime | LCD Screen | Ultra Wide Input Voltage Range | Total isolation",
        "marketing": "The Vertiv Liebert GXT MT+ CX 1 kVA SB Uninterruptible Power Supply is a high-performance, true online double conversion system designed for critical applications like data centers and financial institutions. It is equipped with an IGBT-based rectifier, and its DSP control technology helps ensure reliability. The unit has a new LCD display for easy monitoring of UPS data, alarms, and fault diagnostics. It offers a double-conversion efficiency of up to 90% and has an active uinput power factor correction of .99. With a wide input voltage range of 110-280 Vac, configurable output voltage options, and generator compatibility, the GXT MT+ CX is optimized for various environmental conditions. Its 4-stage extendable charging design and adjustable battery charging current enhance battery performance and runtime. The UPS also supports intelligent monitoring through standard RS232/USB ports and has a slot for additional communication options.",
