        "name": "Vertiv CLRA Local Rack Access Console | 18.5\" LCD Panel | With KVM Cables",
        "fullDescription": "Vertiv CLRA Local Rack Access Console | 18.5\" LCD Panel | With KVM Cables - With 3-in-1 Standard KVM Cables |CE-certified |Global keyboard language support| High Definition Resolution (1920 Ã— 1080)",
        "longDesc": "With 3-in-1 Standard KVM Cables |CE-certified |Global keyboard language support| High Definition Resolution (1920 Ã— 1080)",
        "marketing": "The Vertiv 18.5\" CLRA Local Rack Access Console with standard KVM cables provides the simplicity, efficiency and ease of use to make it the ideal data center access point. When connected to a KVM switch, the CLRA line enables ease of access to multiple servers making software upgrades, troubleshooting and system monitoring convenient and less time-consuming, protecting uptime and staff time. Compatible with all Vertiv Avocent data center KVM switches, the Vertiv CLRA includes a widescreen LCD console tray and full desktop-style keyboard with touchpad. It eliminates the clutter of crash carts, monitors and keyboards. This compact 1U unit supports the next-generation rails that allow seamless installation into the racks without any tools. Detent lock engages when stowed in the rack. Save space by installing an Avocent KVM (AV3000/AV100 series) in the same 1U space. Its minimal power draw during standby and operation saves energy and money.",
