        "techSpecsHtml": "<div id=\"detailSpec\"><h4>General Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Manufacturer</td><td>Vertiv</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Part Number</td><td>2330052</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Website Address</td><td>http://www.vertiv.com/</td></tr><tr><td>Brand Name</td><td>AVOCENT</td></tr><tr><td>Product Model</td><td>CLRA19KMM16D</td></tr><tr><td>Product Name</td><td>CLRA19KMM16D LCD Rack Console</td></tr><tr><td>Marketing Information</td><td>The Vertiv 18.5\" CLRA Local Rack Access Console with 16-Port IPKVM switch and 16 IQ MPUIQ-VMCHS provides the simplicity, efficiency and ease of use to make it the ideal data center access point. When connected to a KVM switch, the CLRA line enables ease of access to multiple servers making software upgrades, troubleshooting and system monitoring convenient and less time-consuming, protecting uptime and staff time. Compatible with all Vertiv Avocent data center KVM switches, the Vertiv CLRA includes a widescreen LCD console tray and full desktop-style keyboard with touchpad. It eliminates the clutter of crash carts, monitors and keyboards. This compact 1U unit supports the next-generation rails that allow seamless installation into the racks without any tools. Detent lock engages when stowed in the rack. Save space by installing an Avocent KVM (AV3000/AV100 series) in the same 1U space. Its minimal power draw during standby and operation saves energy and money.</td></tr><tr><td>Product Type</td><td>LCD Rack Console</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Technical Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>KVM Switch</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Number of Computers Supported</td><td>16</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Display & Graphics</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Screen Size</td><td>46.99 cm (18.50\")</td></tr><tr><td>Display Screen Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>Screen Mode</td><td>Full HD</td></tr><tr><td>Screen Resolution</td><td>1920 x 1080</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Input Devices</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Keyboard</td><td>Yes</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Interfaces/Ports</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>VGA</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Number of USB Ports</td><td>2</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Power Description</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Input Voltage</td><td><ul><li>120 V AC</li><li>230 V AC</li></ul></td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Physical Characteristics</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Rack Height</td><td>1U</td></tr><tr><td>Height</td><td>4.25 cm (1.67\")</td></tr><tr><td>Width</td><td>52.64 cm (20.72\")</td></tr><tr><td>Depth</td><td>48.13 cm (18.95\")</td></tr><tr><td>Weight (Approximate)</td><td>8.30 kg</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Miscellaneous</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Package Contents</td><td><ul> <li>CLRA19KMM16D LCD Rack Console</li> <li>4-in-1 Standard KVM Cables</li> <li>Console Tray</li> <li>16 x IQ Modules</li> <li>16 Port IPKVM Switch</li> </ul></td></tr><tr><td>Certifications & Standards</td><td><ul> <li>UL</li> <li>CE</li> <li>CCC</li> <li>PSE</li> <li>RCM</li> </ul></td></tr><hr></tbody></table>",
