                                "The Vertiv Geist F0126850 is a 16A, 230V, 0U vertical rack power distribution unit (PDU). It has (20) locking IEC C13 outlets, (4) locking IEC C19 outlets, and a 2P+E (IP44) plug providing 3.6kW in power capacity. This model comes with a black powder coating for the chassis, with six more color options available. Vertiv Geist Basic Rack PDUs are UL-listed and are not batch-tested. It is equipped with patented U-Lock technology which helps secure power cords and lessen the chances of power loss caused by accidental disconnections of plugs.  The RoHS-compliant rPDUs undergo rigorous individual tests for reliability and functionality before shipping. The unit comes with a three-year warranty that can be extended to five-years if registered within 120 days of purchase."
