        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: 14240230\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: Geist\r\nProduct Series: rPDU\r\nProduct Model: CI10037L\r\nProduct Name: rPDU CI10037L 24-Outlets PDU\r\nMarketing Information: The Vertiv Geist 14240230 is a 16A, 230V, 0U metered vertical rack power distribution unit. It has 20 Locking IEC C13 outlets, 4 Locking IEC C19 outlets and a 3m power cord with 2P+E (IP44) plug providing 3.6kW in power capacity. This Metered Data Center rPDU provides a real-time view of power usage from a local LED display. It also offers Visible Light Communication technology through the Vertiv rPDU scanner app, which allows you to see complete power usage data locally from a mobile device. Each rack mount PDU undergoes individual testing for functionality to ensure your network is powered by a reliable smart power strip. The unit comes with a three-year warranty that can be extended to five-years if registered within 120 days of purchase.\r\nProduct Type: PDU\r\nPDU Type: Metered\r\nPhase: Single Phase\r\nPlug/Connector Type: 2P+E (IP44)\r\nPlug/Connector Detail: 1 x 2P+E (IP44)\r\nReceptacle Type: U-Lock IEC 60320 C13, U-Lock IEC 60320 C19\r\nReceptacle Detail: 20 x U-Lock IEC 60320 C13, 4 x U-Lock IEC 60320 C19\r\nLocking Receptacles: IEC 60320 C13, IEC 60320 C19\r\nInput Voltage: 230 V\r\nInput Voltage Range: 200 V AC - 240 V AC\r\nOutput Voltage: 240 V AC\r\nOutput Voltage Range: 200 V AC - 240 V AC\r\nPower Rating (Watt): 3.60 kW\r\nInput Current: 16 A\r\nRemote Outlet Switching: No\r\nSerial Port: No\r\nModem (RJ-11): No\r\nModem (RJ-12): No\r\nModem (RJ-22): No\r\nNetwork (RJ-45): No\r\nUSB: No\r\nColor Family: Black\r\nProduct Color: Black\r\nMounting Orientation: Vertical\r\nMount Type: Cabinet-mountable, Rack-mountable\r\nForm Factor: Hot-swappable\r\nRack Height: 0U\r\nCord Length: 3 m (118.11\")\r\nWidth: 5.10 cm (2.01\")\r\nDepth: 5.10 cm (2.01\")\r\nLength: 1.38 m (54.45\")\r\nEnergy Star: No\r\nCountry of Origin: China\r\nTAA Compliant: No\r\nEnvironmentally Friendly: Yes\r\nEnvironmental Compliance: Restriction of Hazardous Substances (RoHS)\r\nLimited Warranty: 5 Year",
