        "fullDescription": "Vertiv Liebert GXT MT+ CX 16A UPS | 1kVA | LB | Long Run Model | True Online - Compact | Reliable | Transformer-free | External Battery Cabinet (EBC) | LCD Display | Communication Cards | SNMP | Dry Contact | ModBus Card | TCP/IP",
        "longDesc": "Compact | Reliable | Transformer-free | External Battery Cabinet (EBC) | LCD Display | Communication Cards | SNMP | Dry Contact | ModBus Card | TCP/IP",
        "marketing": "The Vertiv Liebert GXT MT+ CX 16A 1kVA UPS is a true online uninterruptible power supply unit that helps ensure continuous, AC power when transferring power sources and helps keep critical loads supported seamlessly. This UPS helps protect expensive devices against  blackouts, brownouts, sags, surges, and noise interference. With its Eco Mode, it helps improve energy efficiency while maintaining performance. The unit's design emphasizes easy serviceability with replaceable components and intelligent networking capabilities. Ideal for mission-critical applications, network workstations, servers, IDF/network closets, large network peripherals, VoIP, and workstations, the Liebert&reg; GXT MT+ CX 16A is a transformer-free UPS providing reliable, uninterrupted power even in harsh environments, with a wide input voltage/frequency window and excellent output regulation.",
