        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: 604402079920\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: Liebert\r\nProduct Model: S600E\r\nProduct Name: S600E 20kVA Tower UPS\r\nMarketing Information: <p>The Vertiv Liebert S600E 20 kVA is a fully digital, highly reliable, double-conversion UPS solution that provides clean and consistent power. This highly efficient solution is ideal for various deployments, including IT racks, network closets, automation control systems, and precision instruments to small sized control rooms among other edge applications. Its cutting-edge design enables seamless integration into various ecosystems. This UPS offers economical three-phase input and three-phase output power for critical loads. It is tailored for global deployment in a low carbon, compact footprint. This efficient UPS offers up to 91% efficiency over a wide range of load conditions that may contribute to OPEX cost savings. The integrated Smart Sleep technology in ECO mode provides a superlative efficiency of up to 94%. With rackmount or tower configuration, it is easy to install and operate.</p>\r\nProduct Type: Double Conversion Online UPS\r\nPlug/Connector Type: Hard Wire 4-wire\r\nTransfer Time: 0 ns\r\nPhase: Three Phase\r\nApplication/Usage: IT Rack, Network Closet, Automation System, Precision Instrument, Control Room, Critical System, Data Center, Server, Workstation, Telecommunication\r\nEfficiency: 91%\r\nLoad Capacity (VA): 20 kVA\r\nLoad Capacity (Watt): 20 kW\r\nInput Voltage: 400 V AC\r\nOutput Voltage: 380 V AC, 400 V AC, 415 V AC\r\nInput Frequency: 50 Hz, 60 Hz, 40 Hz, 70 Hz\r\nInput Power Factor: 0.99\r\nOutput Power Factor: 1\r\nDisplay: LCD\r\nNetwork Management: Intelligent Card Slot, Smart RS-232/USB, Web/SNMP\r\nNetwork (RJ-45): Yes\r\nNumber of Batteries: 32\r\nBattery Characteristics: Sealed/Maintenance-free/Valve-regulated/Tubular\r\nBattery Chemistry: Lead Acid\r\nMaximum Operating Temperature: 50&deg;C\r\nStorage Relative Humidity: 5% - 95%\r\nColor Family: Black\r\nProduct Color: Black\r\nForm Factor: Tower\r\nHeight: 1.30 m (51.18\")\r\nWidth: 33.50 cm (13.19\")\r\nDepth: 65.40 cm (25.75\")\r\nWeight (Approximate): 175 kg",
