        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: 505100679010\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: Liebert\r\nProduct Model: Power Bank 600 RT 3 X 1\r\nProduct Name: Power Bank 600 RT 3 X 1 6kVA Rack/Tower UPS\r\nMarketing Information: <p>The Vertiv Liebert Powerbank 600 RT UPS is a fully-digital, highly reliable, double-conversion UPS solution that provides clean and consistent power. This highly efficient solution is ideal for various deployments, including IT racks, network closets, automation control systems, and precision instruments to small sized control rooms among other edge applications. Its cutting-edge design enables seamless integration into various ecosystems. This 6kVA UPS offers three-phase input power for critical loads. It is tailored for global deployment in a low carbon, compact footprint. This efficient UPS offers up to &gt;90% efficiency over a wide range of load conditions that contribute to OPEX cost savings.</p>\r\nProduct Type: Double Conversion Online UPS\r\nTransfer Time: 20 ms\r\nPhase: Three Phase\r\nEfficiency Detail: 89% (Double Conversion Mode), 94% (Eco Mode)\r\nApplication/Usage: Mission Critical Equipment, Data Center, Server Farm, Workstation, Telecommunication, IT Rack, Network Closet, Automation System, Precision Instrument\r\nFeatures: Built-in Bypass Switch\r\nLoad Capacity (VA): 6 kVA\r\nLoad Capacity (Watt): 6 kW\r\nInput Voltage: 230 V AC, 120 V AC\r\nInput Voltage Range: 100 V AC - 288 V AC\r\nOutput Voltage: 220 V AC, 230 V AC, 240 V AC\r\nInput Frequency: 40 Hz, 50 Hz, 60 Hz, 70 Hz\r\nInput Power Factor: 0.99\r\nOutput Power Factor: 1\r\nDisplay: LCD\r\nNetwork Management: SNMP/Modbus, Intelligent Card Slot\r\nNetwork (RJ-45): Yes\r\nNumber of Batteries: 16\r\nBattery Characteristics: Maintenance-free, Sealed, Valve-regulated\r\nBattery Chemistry: Lead Acid\r\nMinimum Operating Temperature: 0&deg;C\r\nMaximum Operating Temperature: 50&deg;C\r\nStorage Temperature: -25&deg;C - 55&deg;C\r\nColor Family: Black\r\nProduct Color: Black\r\nHeight: 55 cm (21.65\")\r\nWidth: 44 cm (17.32\")\r\nDepth: 55 cm (21.65\")\r\nRack Height: 13U\r\nForm Factor: Rack/Tower\r\nWeight (Approximate): 96 kg\r\nCertifications & Standards: <p>IP20</p>",
