        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: 526600063004\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: Liebert\r\nProduct Series: GXT MT+\r\nProduct Name: GXT MT+ 6000VA Tower UPS\r\nMarketing Information: The Vertiv Liebert GXT MT+ uninterruptible power supply (UPS) offers power conditioning and battery backup to critical IT equipment like servers and network gear, helping ensure your business-critical applications are protected during an unexpected loss of power or power surge. This online UPS protects against different kinds of power fluctuations and automatically switches to battery backup when power loss is detected. It meets safety criteria and electromagnetic compatibility standards while offering intelligent monitoring and network management functions. The 6kVA single-phase UPS can achieve up to 91% efficiency in double conversion mode and up to 97% in ECO mode.\r\nProduct Type: Double Conversion Online UPS\r\nPhase: Single Phase\r\nEfficiency Detail: 91% (AC Mode), 97% (Eco Mode)\r\nApplication/Usage: IT Equipment, Server, Business-critical System, Communication System, VoIP, Data Center, Server Room, ATM\r\nLoad Capacity (VA): 6 kVA\r\nLoad Capacity (Watt): 4.80 kW\r\nInput Voltage: 230 V AC\r\nInput Voltage Range: 160 V AC - 300 V AC\r\nOutput Voltage: 208 V AC, 220 V AC, 230 V AC, 240 V AC\r\nInput Frequency: 46 Hz, 54 Hz, 56 Hz, 64 Hz\r\nOutput Frequency: 46 Hz, 54 Hz, 56 Hz, 64 Hz, 50 Hz, 60 Hz\r\nInput Frequency Converter: Yes\r\nWaveform Type: Pure Sine Wave\r\nInput Power Factor: 0.99\r\nOutput Power Factor: 0.8\r\nDisplay: LCD\r\nNetwork Management: Smart RS-232/USB, RS485/Dry Contact/SNMP Card\r\nAlarm: Battery Mode, Low Battery, Overload, Fault\r\nStatus Indicators: <ul><li>  UPS status</li><li>  Load level</li><li>  Battery level</li><li>  Input/Output voltage</li><li>  Discharge timer</li><li>  Fault conditions</li></ul>\r\nSerial Port: Yes\r\nUSB: Yes\r\nBattery Characteristics: Valve-regulated, Tubular\r\nOperating Humidity: 0% - 95%\r\nHeight: 31.80 cm (12.52\")\r\nWidth: 19 cm (7.48\")\r\nDepth: 36.90 cm (14.53\")\r\nForm Factor: Tower\r\nWeight (Approximate): 21 kg",
