        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: 505102079030\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: Liebert\r\nProduct Series: ITA2\r\nProduct Name: ITA2 20kVA Rack/tower UPS\r\nMarketing Information: <p>The Vertiv Liebert ITA2 is a fully-digital, highly reliable, online UPS solution that provides clean and consistent power. This highly efficient solution is ideal for various deployments, including IT racks, network closets, automation control systems, and precision instruments to small sized control rooms among other edge applications. Its cutting-edge design enables seamless integration into various ecosystems. This UPS offers single-phase and three-phase output. It is tailored for global deployment in a low carbon, compact footprint. It offers best-in-class efficiency of up to 96.5% in double conversion mode over a wide range of load conditions. It is designed with a high power factor in a small footprint. With rackmount or tower configuration, it is easy to install and operate. </p>\r\nProduct Type: Double Conversion Online UPS\r\nPlug/Connector Type: Hard Wire 4-wire\r\nReceptacle Type: Terminal Block\r\nProtection Type: Surge\r\nPhase: Single Phase/Three Phase\r\nApplication/Usage: IT Rack, Network Closet, Automation System, Precision Instrument, Control Room, Data Center, Server, Workstation, Telecommunication, Network, Critical System\r\nEfficiency: 96.5%\r\nLoad Capacity (VA): 20 kVA\r\nInput Voltage: 120 V AC, 230 V AC, 380 V AC, 400 V AC, 415 V AC\r\nInput Voltage Range: 176 V AC - 288 V AC, 100 V AC - 176 V AC\r\nOutput Voltage: 220 V AC, 230 V AC, 240 V AC, 380 V AC, 400 V AC, 415 V AC\r\nInput Frequency: 50 Hz, 40 Hz, 70 Hz, 60 Hz\r\nOutput Frequency: 50 Hz, 60 Hz\r\nInput Power Factor: 0.99\r\nOutput Power Factor: 1\r\nDisplay: LCD\r\nMaximum Operating Temperature: 50&deg;C\r\nStorage Relative Humidity: 5% - 95%\r\nSound Emission (A-Weighted): 58 dB(A)\r\nForm Factor: Rack/Tower\r\nRack Height: 2U\r\nHeight: 13 cm (5.12\")\r\nWidth: 43 cm (16.93\")\r\nDepth: 57 cm (22.44\")\r\nWeight (Approximate): 23 kg\r\nCertifications & Standards: <ul><li>  IEC/EN 62040-1</li><li>  IEC/EN 62040-2</li><li>  VFI-SS-111</li></ul>\r\nEnergy Star: Yes\r\nEnvironmental Compliance: Restriction of Hazardous Substances (RoHS)",
