        "techSpecsHtml": "<div id=\"detailSpec\"><h4>General Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Manufacturer</td><td>Vertiv</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Part Number</td><td>VP7UV0A3</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Website Address</td><td>http://www.vertiv.com/</td></tr><tr><td>Brand Name</td><td>Geist</td></tr><tr><td>Product Line</td><td>Geist Upgradeable</td></tr><tr><td>Product Series</td><td>UPDU</td></tr><tr><td>Product Name</td><td>UPDU VP7UV0A3 rPDU</td></tr><tr><td>Marketing Information</td><td>The Vertiv Geist VP7UV0A3 is a vertical rack power distribution unit with a universal input that supports common AC power configurations. It has (24) Combination C13/C19 receptacles providing 22kW of power capacity. This unit can accommodate input power ranging from 32A-63A and 208V-415V in both single-phase and three-phase configurations. It helps simplify the rPDU procurement process since users can use a single model to work with different power sources. It is integrated with the Vertiv Geist Next Generation Interchangeable Monitoring Device (IMD). It has a 128x128 high-contrast LCD that displays the power usage. It features enhanced security with a secure boot that helps protect data and operations. It also has a redundant power-sharing port that connects two IMDs in the rack and provides backup power in case of power loss. The units are Dual Listed (UL/CE), TAA-Compliant, and individually tested for functionality and reliability.</td></tr><tr><td>Product Type</td><td>PDU</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Technical Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>PDU Type</td><td>Switched Outlet Monitored</td></tr><tr><td>Phase</td><td>Single Phase/Three Phase</td></tr><tr><td>Plug/Connector Type</td><td>Universal Input</td></tr><tr><td>Plug/Connector Detail</td><td>1 x Universal Input</td></tr><tr><td>Receptacle Type</td><td>Combination C13/C19</td></tr><tr><td>Receptacle Detail</td><td>24 x Combination C13/C19</td></tr><tr><td>Protection Type</td><td>Overcurrent Protection</td></tr><tr><td>Locking Receptacles</td><td>Ulock</td></tr><tr><td>Features</td><td>Touch Screen Display</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Power Description</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Input Voltage</td><td><ul><li>230 V AC</li><li>415 V AC</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Power Rating (Watt)</td><td>22 kW</td></tr><tr><td>Input Current</td><td>63 A</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Management</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Management</td><td><li>DHCP</li><li>HTTP</li><li>HTTPS</li><li>IPv4</li><li>IPv6</li><li>LDAP</li><li>NTP</li><li>RADIUS</li><li>RSTP</li><li>SSH</li><li>SMTP</li><li>SNMP (v1/v2c/v3)</li><li>Modbus TCP/IP</li><li>Syslog</li><li>TACACS+</li></td></tr><tr><td>Remote Outlet Switching</td><td>Yes</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Interfaces/Ports</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Serial Port</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Modem (RJ-11)</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Modem (RJ-12)</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Modem (RJ-22)</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Network (RJ-45)</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>USB</td><td>Yes</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Physical Characteristics</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Color Family</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Product Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Mounting Orientation</td><td>Vertical</td></tr><tr><td>Mount Type</td><td>Rack-mountable</td></tr><tr><td>Rack Height</td><td>0U</td></tr><tr><td>Width</td><td>5.08 cm (2\")</td></tr><tr><td>Depth</td><td>6.60 cm (2.60\")</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>1.83 m (72\")</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Miscellaneous</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Vertiv Geist Facility Side Cable (FSC)</td></tr><tr><td>Certifications & Standards</td><td><li>UL & c-UL Listed 60950</li><li>CE Marked</li><li>Complies with EN 55032 and EN 55024</li><li>Complies with IEC 60950-1 (CB Certificate Available)</li><li>RCM Mark (EMC Only)</li><li>FCC Part 15 Class A Conformance</li></td></tr><tr><td>Energy Star</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Country of Origin</td><td>United States</td></tr><tr><td>TAA Compliant</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Environmentally Friendly</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Environmental Compliance</td><td>China Restriction of Hazardous Substances (China RoHS)</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Warranty</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Limited Warranty</td><td>5 Year</td></tr><tr><td>Additional Warranty Information</td><td>5-year limited warranty if registered within 120 days of purchase, otherwise warranty defaults to 3 years</td></tr><hr></tbody></table>",
