        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: VP7UV0A3\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: Geist\r\nProduct Line: Geist Upgradeable\r\nProduct Series: UPDU\r\nProduct Name: UPDU VP7UV0A3 rPDU\r\nMarketing Information: The Vertiv Geist VP7UV0A3 is a vertical rack power distribution unit with a universal input that supports common AC power configurations. It has (24) Combination C13/C19 receptacles providing 22kW of power capacity. This unit can accommodate input power ranging from 32A-63A and 208V-415V in both single-phase and three-phase configurations. It helps simplify the rPDU procurement process since users can use a single model to work with different power sources. It is integrated with the Vertiv Geist Next Generation Interchangeable Monitoring Device (IMD). It has a 128x128 high-contrast LCD that displays the power usage. It features enhanced security with a secure boot that helps protect data and operations. It also has a redundant power-sharing port that connects two IMDs in the rack and provides backup power in case of power loss. The units are Dual Listed (UL/CE), TAA-Compliant, and individually tested for functionality and reliability.\r\nProduct Type: PDU\r\nPDU Type: Switched Outlet Monitored\r\nPhase: Single Phase/Three Phase\r\nPlug/Connector Type: Universal Input\r\nPlug/Connector Detail: 1 x Universal Input\r\nReceptacle Type: Combination C13/C19\r\nReceptacle Detail: 24 x Combination C13/C19\r\nProtection Type: Overcurrent Protection\r\nLocking Receptacles: Ulock\r\nFeatures: Touch Screen Display\r\nInput Voltage: 230 V AC, 415 V AC\r\nPower Rating (Watt): 22 kW\r\nInput Current: 63 A\r\nManagement: <li>DHCP</li><li>HTTP</li><li>HTTPS</li><li>IPv4</li><li>IPv6</li><li>LDAP</li><li>NTP</li><li>RADIUS</li><li>RSTP</li><li>SSH</li><li>SMTP</li><li>SNMP (v1/v2c/v3)</li><li>Modbus TCP/IP</li><li>Syslog</li><li>TACACS+</li>\r\nRemote Outlet Switching: Yes\r\nSerial Port: Yes\r\nModem (RJ-11): No\r\nModem (RJ-12): Yes\r\nModem (RJ-22): No\r\nNetwork (RJ-45): Yes\r\nUSB: Yes\r\nColor Family: Black\r\nProduct Color: Black\r\nMounting Orientation: Vertical\r\nMount Type: Rack-mountable\r\nRack Height: 0U\r\nWidth: 5.08 cm (2\")\r\nDepth: 6.60 cm (2.60\")\r\nLength: 1.83 m (72\")\r\nCompatibility: Vertiv Geist Facility Side Cable (FSC)\r\nCertifications & Standards: <li>UL & c-UL Listed 60950</li><li>CE Marked</li><li>Complies with EN 55032 and EN 55024</li><li>Complies with IEC 60950-1 (CB Certificate Available)</li><li>RCM Mark (EMC Only)</li><li>FCC Part 15 Class A Conformance</li>\r\nEnergy Star: No\r\nCountry of Origin: United States\r\nTAA Compliant: Yes\r\nEnvironmentally Friendly: Yes\r\nEnvironmental Compliance: China Restriction of Hazardous Substances (China RoHS)\r\nLimited Warranty: 5 Year\r\nAdditional Warranty Information: 5-year limited warranty if registered within 120 days of purchase, otherwise warranty defaults to 3 years",
