        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: GXE32000IRT2UXL\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: Liebert\r\nProduct Series: GXE\r\nProduct Name: GXE3-1000IRT2UXL UPS\r\nMarketing Information: The Vertiv Liebert GXE UPS is an affordable, efficient UPS with high output power factor (0.9PF), which enables continuous and reliable power to more connected devices. With online double conversion, this 2kVA UPS protects devices against many disturbances. It is ideal for critical applications in financial, government, and manufacturing industries. It has flexible rack/tower mounting options. Up to 4 additional external battery cabinets provide scalable runtime for those applications requiring longer period of backup in case of AC mains failures. The high efficiency in both online and ECO modes of operation (up to 95% in ECO mode) for this already affordable UPS further drives energy and operational costs savings. An optional network management card allows remote management and server shutdown. Its extended runtime and multiple monitoring options make this compact UPS ideal for delivering best-in-class power protection to equipment at the edge of networks or in remote sites.\r\nPackaged Quantity: 1 / Pack\r\nProduct Type: Double Conversion Online UPS\r\nReceptacle Type: IEC 60320 C13\r\nReceptacle Detail: 8 x IEC 60320 C13\r\nEMI/RFI Noise Filter: Yes\r\nPhase: Single Phase\r\nEfficiency Detail: 95% (Eco Mode)\r\nApplication/Usage: Financial, Government, Manufacturing, Industry, Critical System, Server, Network Closet\r\nFeatures: Audible Alarm\r\nLoad Capacity (VA): 2 kVA\r\nLoad Capacity (Watt): 1.80 kW\r\nInput Voltage: 120 V AC, 290 V AC\r\nOutput Voltage: 220 V AC, 230 V AC, 240 V AC\r\nWaveform Type: Pure Sine Wave\r\nCircuit Breaker: Yes\r\nOutput Power Factor: 0.9\r\nDisplay: LCD\r\nSerial Port: No\r\nNetwork (RJ-45): No\r\nUSB: Yes\r\nEPO Port: Yes\r\nNumber of Batteries: 4\r\nBattery Characteristics: Valve-regulated\r\nBattery Chemistry: Lead Acid\r\nBackup/Run Time (Full Load): 3.20 Minute\r\nBackup/Run Time (Half Load): 9 Minute\r\nBattery Life: 5 Year\r\nHot Swappable: Yes\r\nReplaceable Battery: Yes\r\nColor Family: Grey\r\nProduct Color: Dark Grey\r\nHeight: 8.64 cm (3.40\")\r\nWidth: 43.69 cm (17.20\")\r\nDepth: 42.93 cm (16.90\")\r\nRack Height: 2U\r\nForm Factor: Rack/Tower\r\nWeight (Approximate): 22.68 kg\r\nTAA Compliant: No\r\nEnvironmental Compliance: Restriction of Hazardous Substances (RoHS), Registration, Evaluation, Authorization and Restriction of Chemicals (REACH), Waste Electrical and Electronic Equipment Directive (WEEE)",
