        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: 536306003014\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: Liebert\r\nProduct Line: itON\r\nProduct Model: 600VA CX\r\nProduct Name: itON 600VA CX Tower UPS\r\nMarketing Information: <p>This Vertiv Liebert&reg; ITON&trade; 600VA CX line-interactive, uninterruptible power supply unit with lithium-ion battery provides power protection and battery backup for your small office or home office setup. It is a cost-effective solution with an AVR for voltage stabilisation, an auto-charging feature at off-mode, and a cold start function. This generator-compatible UPS comes with a five-year warranty on both the UPS and battery.</p>\r\nProduct Type: Line-interactive UPS\r\nAVR: Yes\r\nOverload Protection: Yes\r\nTransfer Time: 6 ms\r\nApplication/Usage: Generator, Home, Office, Computer, Electronic Equipment\r\nFeatures: Cold Start Function, Auto Restart, Audible Alarm\r\nLoad Capacity (VA): 600 VA\r\nLoad Capacity (Watt): 360 W\r\nInput Voltage: 120 V AC, 230 V AC\r\nInput Voltage Range: 140 V AC - 300 V AC\r\nInput Frequency: 50 Hz\r\nOutput Frequency: 50 Hz\r\nWaveform Type: Simulated Sine Wave\r\nAlarm: Battery Mode, Low Battery, Overload, Replace Battery, Fault\r\nStatus Indicators: <p><b>LED Indicators:</b></p><ul><li>  AC Mode </li><li>  Battery Mode </li><li>  Fault</li></ul>\r\nNumber of Batteries: 1\r\nBattery Chemistry: Lithium Ion (Li-Ion)\r\nBattery Size: 12.8V\r\nBattery Capacity: 6000 mAh\r\nTypical Battery Recharge Time: 4 Hour\r\nReplaceable Battery: Yes\r\nMinimum Operating Temperature: 0&deg;C\r\nMaximum Operating Temperature: 40&deg;C\r\nStorage Temperature: -15&deg;C - 50&deg;C\r\nOperating Humidity: 0% - 95%\r\nHeight: 14.30 cm (5.63\")\r\nWidth: 10.10 cm (3.98\")\r\nDepth: 27.90 cm (10.98\")\r\nForm Factor: Tower\r\nWeight (Approximate): 3 kg\r\nLimited Warranty: 5 Year\r\nAdditional Warranty Information: <p>5-year warranty on the UPS and the Lithium-ion battery</p>",
