        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: 504900139000\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: Liebert\r\nProduct Series: ITA2\r\nProduct Name: ITA2 1kVA Rack/tower UPS\r\nMarketing Information: <p>The Vertiv&trade; Liebert&reg; ITA2 (1-3 kVA) series is a transformer-free UPS designed to offer compact, efficient, and reliable power to modern sensitive electronic equipment. With a unity output power factor, the ITA2 matches the needs of modern IT loads, and with its wide input voltage and frequency range, it helps reduce the need for battery intervention, and can help extend battery life. It offers best-in-class efficiency of up to 94% in double conversion mode over a wide range of load conditions which help contribute to OPEX cost savings. The ITA2 features a multi-lingual LCD user interface allowing close control and monitoring of system status and performance. ITA2 has been rigorously tested under extreme conditions like dusty environments, high altitude, very high and low ambient temperatures, and seismic conditions among others. These capabilities make the ITA2 an ideal choice for a wide range of commercial applications.</p>\r\nProduct Type: Double Conversion Online UPS\r\nReceptacle Type: Terminal Block\r\nTransfer Time: 0 ns\r\nEfficiency Detail: 98% (ECO Mode), 94% (Dual Conversion Mode)\r\nApplication/Usage: Critical System, Commercial, Computer, Workstation, Server Room, Data Center, Network Closet, VoIP\r\nSurge Suppression: Yes\r\nLoad Capacity (VA): 1 kVA\r\nLoad Capacity (Watt): 1 kW\r\nInput Voltage: 120 V AC, 230 V AC\r\nInput Voltage Range: 176 V AC - 288 V AC, 100 V AC - 176 V AC\r\nOutput Voltage: 220 V AC, 230 V AC, 240 V AC\r\nInput Frequency: 50 Hz, 40 Hz, 70 Hz\r\nWaveform Type: Sinusoidal\r\nInput Power Factor: 0.99\r\nOutput Power Factor: 1\r\nDisplay: LCD\r\nNetwork Management: SNMP/HTTP Remote Monitoring\r\nNetwork (RJ-45): Yes\r\nUSB: Yes\r\nDC System Voltage: 36 V DC\r\nBattery Characteristics: Maintenance-free, Sealed\r\nBattery Chemistry: Lead Acid\r\nMinimum Operating Temperature: 0&deg;C\r\nMaximum Operating Temperature: 50&deg;C\r\nStorage Temperature: -15&deg;C - 40&deg;C\r\nStorage Relative Humidity: 5% - 95%\r\nHeight: 8.50 cm (3.35\")\r\nWidth: 43 cm (16.93\")\r\nDepth: 40 cm (15.75\")\r\nRack Height: 2U\r\nForm Factor: Rack/Tower\r\nWeight (Approximate): 7.10 kg\r\nCertifications & Standards: <ul><li>  IEC/EN 62040-1:2008+A1:2013</li><li>  Conducted Emission:IEC/EN 62040-2 C2, Harmonic current:IEC/EN 61000-3-2</li><li>  IEC/EN 61000-4-5</li></ul>\r\nEnergy Star: Yes\r\nEnvironmental Compliance: Restriction of Hazardous Substances (RoHS)",
