        "fullDescription": "Vertiv Liebert PSA5 itON-SOHO UPS 650VA/390W 162-290VAC Line Interactive UPS - Compact size and lightweight | Built-in Boost and Buck AVR | Surge protection against transient voltages | Universal sockets",
        "longDesc": "Compact size and lightweight | Built-in Boost and Buck AVR | Surge protection against transient voltages | Universal sockets",
        "marketing": "The Vertiv Liebert PSA itON-SOHO uninterruptible power supply (UPS) provides efficient power protection for small office and home office (SOHO). Compact and light, it is ideal for desktop personal computers, professional workstations, small routers, bridges and hubs, point-of-sale terminals and other small office applications. Automatic Voltage Regulation (AVR) extends battery life. This UPS provides ample run time to save work in progress and allows orderly shutdown of your critical equipment. This battery backup comes with universal sockets, mobile charger (for 650VA & 850VA model) and simple controls for easy operation. The Vertiv Liebert PSA itON-SOHO UPS, 650VA-1000VA is backed by a 2-year replacement warranty.",
