        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: EDGE-1000IRM1U\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: VERTIV\r\nProduct Line: EDGE\r\nProduct Model: EDGE-1000IRM1U\r\nProduct Name: EDGE-1000IRM1U 1kVA Rack-mountable UPS\r\nMarketing Information: The Vertiv Edge uninterruptible power supply (UPS) is designed to protect server and networking equipment in distributed and Edge IT applications. With compact 1U rack format, this 1000VA UPS offers reliable protection from downtime and damage caused by power spikes, swells and brownouts. Automatic Voltage Regulation (AVR) extends battery life and safeguards critical equipment. With sine wave output, this line interactive UPS ensures availability of network closets and Edge data centers. It operates at up to 98% efficiency in normal operation mode, providing energy savings. Add optional Vertiv Intellislot SNMP/Webcards for remote power management and OS's shutdown with free Vertiv Power Assist software. The Edge family has a wide range of power ratings, from 500VA up to 3000VA and form factors, such as mini-tower, 1U rack and rack/tower. It is easy to install, configure and operate and comes with an intuitive, color LCD screen. It has a standard 3-year Vertiv UPS warranty.\r\nProduct Type: Line-interactive UPS\r\nAVR: Yes\r\nPlug/Connector Type: IEC 60320 C14\r\nReceptacle Type: IEC 60320 C13\r\nReceptacle Detail: 6 x IEC 60320 C13\r\nCord Length: 3 m (118.11\")\r\nTransfer Time: 6 ms\r\nPhase: Single Phase\r\nApplication/Usage: Business, Server, Network, Critical System, Data Center, IOT Device, Data Storage, Edge Computing\r\nLoad Capacity (VA): 1 kVA\r\nLoad Capacity (Watt): 900 W\r\nInput Voltage: 278 V\r\nOutput Voltage: 200 V AC, 208 V AC, 220 V AC, 230 V AC, 240 V AC\r\nInput Frequency: 65 Hz\r\nWaveform Type: Pure Sine Wave\r\nSurge Energy Rating: 624 J\r\nCircuit Breaker: Yes\r\nNetwork Management: SNMP/Webcard\r\nAlarm: Yes\r\nStatus Indicators: Color and graphic LCD\r\nSerial Port: No\r\nVGA: No\r\nModem (RJ-11): Yes\r\nNetwork (RJ-45): No\r\nUSB: Yes\r\nEPO Port: Yes\r\nUSB (HID Compliant) Port: Yes\r\nDC System Voltage: 24 V DC\r\nNumber of Batteries: 4\r\nBattery Characteristics: Valve-regulated, Non-spillable\r\nBattery Chemistry: Lead Acid\r\nBattery Size: 6V\r\nBattery Capacity: 9000 mAh\r\nBackup/Run Time (Full Load): 5 Minute\r\nBackup/Run Time (Half Load): 15 Minute\r\nNumber of External Battery Cabinets: 6\r\nBattery Life: 5 Year\r\nTypical Battery Recharge Time: 3 Hour\r\nHot Swappable: Yes\r\nMaximum Operating Temperature: 40&deg;C\r\nStorage Temperature: -25&deg;C - 55&deg;C\r\nMaximum Operating Elevation: 3 km (118110.24\")\r\nSound Emission: 45 dB\r\nColor Family: Black\r\nProduct Color: Black\r\nHeight: 4.40 cm (1.73\")\r\nWidth: 43.80 cm (17.24\")\r\nDepth: 48 cm (18.90\")\r\nRack Height: 1U\r\nForm Factor: Rack-mountable\r\nWeight (Approximate): 17 kg\r\nPackage Contents: <ul><li>EDGE-1000IRM1U 1kVA Rack-mountable UPS</li><li>Adjustable 4-post rack mounting kit</li><li>USB Cable</li><li>Power Assist software (free download from Vertiv.com)</li><li>Safety Manual</li><li>Quick Installation Guide</li><li>Input and output power cables (depending on rating and model type)</li></ul>\r\nSoftware Included: Power Assist\r\nEnergy Star: No\r\nCountry of Origin: China\r\nTAA Compliant: No\r\nEnvironmentally Friendly: Yes\r\nEnvironmental Compliance: Restriction of Hazardous Substances (RoHS), Registration, Evaluation, Authorization and Restriction of Chemicals (REACH)\r\nLimited Warranty: 2 Year",
