        "techSpecsHtml": "<div id=\"detailSpec\"><h4>General Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Manufacturer</td><td>Vertiv</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Part Number</td><td>EDGE-1500IRT2UXL</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Website Address</td><td>http://www.vertiv.com/</td></tr><tr><td>Brand Name</td><td>VERTIV</td></tr><tr><td>Product Line</td><td>EDGE</td></tr><tr><td>Product Model</td><td>EDGE-1500IRT2UXL</td></tr><tr><td>Product Name</td><td>EDGE-1500IRT2UXL 1500VA Rack/Tower UPS</td></tr><tr><td>Marketing Information</td><td>The Vertiv Edge uninterruptible power supply (UPS) is designed to protect server and networking equipment in distributed and Edge IT applications. With 2U convertible rack/tower format, this 1500VA UPS offers reliable protection from downtime and damage caused by power spikes, swells and brownouts. Automatic Voltage Regulation (AVR) extends battery life and safeguards critical equipment. With sine wave output, this line interactive UPS ensures availability of network closets and Edge data centers. It operates at up to 98% efficiency in normal operation mode, providing energy savings. Add optional Vertiv Intellislot SNMP/Webcards for remote power management and OS's shutdown with free Vertiv Power Assist software. The Edge family has a wide range of power ratings, from 500VA up to 3000VA and form factors, such as mini-tower, 1U rack and rack/tower. It is easy to install, configure and operate and comes with an intuitive, color LCD screen. It has a standard 3-year Vertiv UPS warranty.</td></tr><tr><td>Product Type</td><td>Line-interactive UPS</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Technical Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>AVR</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Plug/Connector Type</td><td>IEC 60320 C14</td></tr><tr><td>Receptacle Type</td><td>IEC 60320 C13</td></tr><tr><td>Receptacle Detail</td><td>6 x IEC 60320 C13</td></tr><tr><td>Transfer Time</td><td>6 ms</td></tr><tr><td>Phase</td><td>Single Phase</td></tr><tr><td>Application/Usage</td><td><ul><li>Business</li><li>Server</li><li>Network</li><li>Critical System</li><li>Data Center</li><li>IOT Device</li><li>Data Storage</li><li>Edge Computing</li></ul></td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Power Description</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Load Capacity (VA)</td><td>1.50 kVA</td></tr><tr><td>Load Capacity (Watt)</td><td>1.35 kW</td></tr><tr><td>Input Voltage</td><td>278 V</td></tr><tr><td>Output Voltage</td><td><ul><li>200 V AC</li><li>208 V AC</li><li>220 V AC</li><li>230 V AC</li><li>240 V AC</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Input Frequency</td><td>65 Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Waveform Type</td><td>Pure Sine Wave</td></tr><tr><td>Surge Energy Rating</td><td>624 J</td></tr><tr><td>Circuit Breaker</td><td>Yes</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Management</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Network Management</td><td>SNMP/Webcard</td></tr><tr><td>Alarm</td><td>Yes</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Controls/Indicators</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Status Indicators</td><td>Color and graphic LCD</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Interfaces/Ports</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>USB</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>EPO Port</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>USB (HID Compliant) Port</td><td>Yes</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Battery Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>DC System Voltage</td><td>48 V DC</td></tr><tr><td>Number of Batteries</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Battery Characteristics</td><td>Valve-regulated, Non-spillable</td></tr><tr><td>Battery Chemistry</td><td>Lead Acid</td></tr><tr><td>Battery Size</td><td>12V</td></tr><tr><td>Battery Capacity</td><td>9000 mAh</td></tr><tr><td>Backup/Run Time (Full Load)</td><td>5 Minute</td></tr><tr><td>Backup/Run Time (Half Load)</td><td>17 Minute</td></tr><tr><td>Number of External Battery Cabinets</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>Typical Battery Recharge Time</td><td>3 Hour</td></tr><tr><td>Hot Swappable</td><td>Yes</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Environmental Conditions</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Maximum Operating Temperature</td><td>40&deg;C</td></tr><tr><td>Storage Temperature</td><td>-25&deg;C - 55&deg;C</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Operating Elevation</td><td>3 km (118110.24\")</td></tr><tr><td>Sound Emission</td><td>45 dB</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Physical Characteristics</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Color Family</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Product Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Height</td><td>8.80 cm (3.46\")</td></tr><tr><td>Width</td><td>43.80 cm (17.24\")</td></tr><tr><td>Depth</td><td>51 cm (20.08\")</td></tr><tr><td>Rack Height</td><td>2U</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>Rack/Tower</td></tr><tr><td>Weight (Approximate)</td><td>20 kg</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Miscellaneous</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Package Contents</td><td><ul><li>EDGE-1500IRT2UXL 1500VA Rack/Tower UPS</li><li>Support Base for Tower Configuration</li><li>USB Cable</li><li>Power Assist Software (free download from Vertiv.com)</li><li>Safety Manual</li><li>Quick Installation Guide</li><li>Input and Output Power Cables (depending on rating and model type)</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Software Included</td><td>Power Assist</td></tr><tr><td>Energy Star</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Country of Origin</td><td>China</td></tr><tr><td>TAA Compliant</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Environmentally Friendly</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Environmental Compliance</td><td><ul><li>Restriction of Hazardous Substances (RoHS)</li><li>Registration, Evaluation, Authorization and Restriction of Chemicals (REACH)</li></ul></td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Warranty</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Limited Warranty</td><td>2 Year</td></tr><hr></tbody></table>",
