        "techSpecsHtml": "<div id=\"detailSpec\"><h4>General Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Manufacturer</td><td>Vertiv</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Part Number</td><td>EDGE-1000IMT</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Website Address</td><td>http://www.vertiv.com/</td></tr><tr><td>Brand Name</td><td>VERTIV</td></tr><tr><td>Product Line</td><td>EDGE</td></tr><tr><td>Product Model</td><td>EDGE-1000IMT</td></tr><tr><td>Product Name</td><td>EDGE-1000IMT 1kVA Tower UPS</td></tr><tr><td>Marketing Information</td><td>The Vertiv Edge uninterruptible power supply (UPS) is designed to protect server and networking equipment in distributed and Edge IT applications. This 1000VA UPS mini-tower offers powerful and reliable protection from downtime and damage caused by power spikes, swells and brownouts. Automatic Voltage Regulation (AVR) extends battery life and safeguards critical equipment. With sine wave output, this line interactive UPS ensures availability of network closets and Edge data centers. It operates at up to 98% efficiency in normal operation mode, providing energy savings. Add optional Vertiv Intellislot SNMP/Webcards for remote power management and OS's shutdown with free Vertiv Power Assist software. The Edge family has a wide range of power ratings, from 500VA up to 3000VA and is available in multiple form factors: mini-tower, 1U rack and rack/tower. It is easy to install, configure and operate and comes with intuitive, color LCD screen. It has a standard 3-year Vertiv UPS warranty.</td></tr><tr><td>Product Type</td><td>Line-interactive UPS</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Technical Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>AVR</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Plug/Connector Type</td><td>IEC 60320 C14</td></tr><tr><td>Receptacle Type</td><td>IEC 60320 C13</td></tr><tr><td>Receptacle Detail</td><td>5 x IEC 60320 C13</td></tr><tr><td>Transfer Time</td><td>6 ms</td></tr><tr><td>Phase</td><td>Single Phase</td></tr><tr><td>Application/Usage</td><td><ul><li>Critical System</li><li>IT Equipment</li><li>Network</li><li>IOT Device</li><li>Server</li><li>Business</li><li>Data Center</li><li>Data Storage</li><li>Electronic</li><li>Edge Computing</li></ul></td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Power Description</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Load Capacity (VA)</td><td>1 kVA</td></tr><tr><td>Load Capacity (Watt)</td><td>900 W</td></tr><tr><td>Input Voltage</td><td>278 V</td></tr><tr><td>Input Voltage Range</td><td>166 V AC - 278 V AC</td></tr><tr><td>Output Voltage</td><td><ul><li>200 V AC</li><li>208 V AC</li><li>220 V AC</li><li>230 V AC</li><li>240 V AC</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Input Frequency</td><td>65 Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Waveform Type</td><td>Pure Sine Wave</td></tr><tr><td>Surge Energy Rating</td><td>624 J</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Management</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Network Management</td><td>SNMP/Webcard</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Controls/Indicators</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Status Indicators</td><td>Color and graphic LCD</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Interfaces/Ports</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Serial Port</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>VGA</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Modem (RJ-11)</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>USB</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>EPO Port</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>USB (HID Compliant) Port</td><td>Yes</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Battery Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Number of Batteries</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>Battery Characteristics</td><td>Valve-regulated, Non-spillable</td></tr><tr><td>Battery Chemistry</td><td>Lead Acid</td></tr><tr><td>Battery Size</td><td>12V</td></tr><tr><td>Battery Capacity</td><td>10000 mAh</td></tr><tr><td>Backup/Run Time (Full Load)</td><td>5 Minute</td></tr><tr><td>Backup/Run Time (Half Load)</td><td>15 Minute</td></tr><tr><td>Number of External Battery Cabinets</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>Typical Battery Recharge Time</td><td>3 Hour</td></tr><tr><td>Hot Swappable</td><td>Yes</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Environmental Conditions</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Maximum Operating Temperature</td><td>40&deg;C</td></tr><tr><td>Storage Temperature</td><td>-25&deg;C - 55&deg;C</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Operating Elevation</td><td>3 km (118110.24\")</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Physical Characteristics</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Height</td><td>22 cm (8.66\")</td></tr><tr><td>Width</td><td>14.50 cm (5.71\")</td></tr><tr><td>Depth</td><td>37 cm (14.57\")</td></tr><tr><td>Rack Height</td><td>1U</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>Tower</td></tr><tr><td>Weight (Approximate)</td><td>12 kg</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Miscellaneous</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Package Contents</td><td><ul><li>EDGE-1000IMT 1kVA Tower UPS</li><li>USB Cable</li><li>Printed Quick Installation And Guide Safety Instructions</li><li>Adjustable 4-post Rack Mounting Kit </li><li>Support Base For Tower Configuration</li><li>Input and output power cables </li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Software Included</td><td>Power Assist</td></tr><tr><td>Country of Origin</td><td>China</td></tr><tr><td>Environmentally Friendly</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Environmental Compliance</td><td><ul><li>Registration, Evaluation, Authorization and Restriction of Chemicals (REACH)</li><li>Restriction of Hazardous Substances (RoHS)</li></ul></td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Warranty</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Limited Warranty</td><td>2 Year</td></tr><hr></tbody></table>",
