        "techSpecsHtml": "<div id=\"detailSpec\"><h4>General Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Manufacturer</td><td>Vertiv</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Part Number</td><td>PSA850-SOHO</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Website Address</td><td>http://www.vertiv.com/</td></tr><tr><td>Brand Name</td><td>Liebert</td></tr><tr><td>Product Series</td><td>PSA itON</td></tr><tr><td>Product Model</td><td>PSA850-SOHO</td></tr><tr><td>Product Name</td><td>PSA5 itON-SOHO UPS 850VA/510W 162-290VAC Line Interactive UPS</td></tr><tr><td>Marketing Information</td><td>The Vertiv Liebert PSA itON-SOHO uninterruptible power supply (UPS) provides efficient power protection for small office and home office (SOHO). Compact and light, it is ideal for desktop personal computers, professional workstations, small routers, bridges and hubs, point-of-sale terminals and other small office applications. Automatic Voltage Regulation (AVR) extends battery life. This UPS provides ample run time to save work in progress and allows orderly shutdown of your critical equipment. This battery backup comes with universal sockets, mobile charger (for 650VA & 850VA model) and simple controls for easy operation. The Vertiv Liebert PSA itON-SOHO UPS, 650VA-1000VA is backed by a 2-year replacement warranty.</td></tr><tr><td>Product Type</td><td>Line-interactive UPS</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Technical Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>AVR</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Receptacle Type</td><td><ul><li>Universal</li><li>USB</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Receptacle Detail</td><td>3 x Universal</td></tr><tr><td>Protection Type</td><td><ul><li>Surge</li><li>Fuse</li><li>Discharge</li><li>Over Charge</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Overload Protection</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Transfer Time</td><td>6 ms</td></tr><tr><td>Phase</td><td>Single Phase</td></tr><tr><td>Application/Usage</td><td><ul><li>SOHO Office</li><li>Business</li><li>IT Infrastructure</li><li>IT Equipment</li><li>Desktop Computer</li><li>Workstation</li><li>Network Hub</li><li>Router</li><li>Network Bridge</li><li>POS Terminal</li><li>Electronic Equipment</li><li>Modem</li><li>Storage Device</li><li>Printer</li><li>Notebook</li><li>Mission Critical Equipment</li></ul></td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Power Description</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Load Capacity (VA)</td><td>850 VA</td></tr><tr><td>Load Capacity (Watt)</td><td>510 W</td></tr><tr><td>Input Voltage</td><td>230 V AC</td></tr><tr><td>Input Voltage Range</td><td>162 V AC - 290 V AC</td></tr><tr><td>Output Voltage</td><td><ul><li>220 V AC</li><li>230 V AC</li><li>240 V AC</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Input Frequency</td><td>60 Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Output Frequency</td><td>60 Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Waveform Type</td><td>Simulated Sine Wave</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Management</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Alarm</td><td><ul><li>Battery Mode</li><li>Low Battery</li><li>Overload</li><li>Fault</li></ul></td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Interfaces/Ports</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Serial Port</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>VGA</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Modem (RJ-11)</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Network (RJ-45)</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>USB</td><td>No</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Battery Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>DC System Voltage</td><td>12 V DC</td></tr><tr><td>Number of Batteries</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Battery Size</td><td>12V</td></tr><tr><td>Battery Capacity</td><td>9000 mAh</td></tr><tr><td>Backup/Run Time (Half Load)</td><td>3 Minute</td></tr><tr><td>Hot Swappable</td><td>No</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Environmental Conditions</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Maximum Operating Temperature</td><td>40&deg;C</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Physical Characteristics</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Height</td><td>20.10 cm (7.91\")</td></tr><tr><td>Width</td><td>27.20 cm (10.71\")</td></tr><tr><td>Depth</td><td>8.50 cm (3.35\")</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>Compact/Desktop/Floor/Wall Mountable</td></tr><tr><td>Weight (Approximate)</td><td>4.90 kg</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Miscellaneous</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Country of Origin</td><td>China</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Warranty</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Limited Warranty</td><td>2 Year</td></tr><hr></tbody></table>",
