        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: PSA850-SOHO\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: Liebert\r\nProduct Series: PSA itON\r\nProduct Model: PSA850-SOHO\r\nProduct Name: PSA5 itON-SOHO UPS 850VA/510W 162-290VAC Line Interactive UPS\r\nMarketing Information: The Vertiv Liebert PSA itON-SOHO uninterruptible power supply (UPS) provides efficient power protection for small office and home office (SOHO). Compact and light, it is ideal for desktop personal computers, professional workstations, small routers, bridges and hubs, point-of-sale terminals and other small office applications. Automatic Voltage Regulation (AVR) extends battery life. This UPS provides ample run time to save work in progress and allows orderly shutdown of your critical equipment. This battery backup comes with universal sockets, mobile charger (for 650VA & 850VA model) and simple controls for easy operation. The Vertiv Liebert PSA itON-SOHO UPS, 650VA-1000VA is backed by a 2-year replacement warranty.\r\nProduct Type: Line-interactive UPS\r\nAVR: Yes\r\nReceptacle Type: Universal, USB\r\nReceptacle Detail: 3 x Universal\r\nProtection Type: Surge, Fuse, Discharge, Over Charge\r\nOverload Protection: Yes\r\nTransfer Time: 6 ms\r\nPhase: Single Phase\r\nApplication/Usage: SOHO Office, Business, IT Infrastructure, IT Equipment, Desktop Computer, Workstation, Network Hub, Router, Network Bridge, POS Terminal, Electronic Equipment, Modem, Storage Device, Printer, Notebook, Mission Critical Equipment\r\nLoad Capacity (VA): 850 VA\r\nLoad Capacity (Watt): 510 W\r\nInput Voltage: 230 V AC\r\nInput Voltage Range: 162 V AC - 290 V AC\r\nOutput Voltage: 220 V AC, 230 V AC, 240 V AC\r\nInput Frequency: 60 Hz\r\nOutput Frequency: 60 Hz\r\nWaveform Type: Simulated Sine Wave\r\nAlarm: Battery Mode, Low Battery, Overload, Fault\r\nSerial Port: No\r\nVGA: No\r\nModem (RJ-11): No\r\nNetwork (RJ-45): No\r\nUSB: No\r\nDC System Voltage: 12 V DC\r\nNumber of Batteries: 1\r\nBattery Size: 12V\r\nBattery Capacity: 9000 mAh\r\nBackup/Run Time (Half Load): 3 Minute\r\nHot Swappable: No\r\nMaximum Operating Temperature: 40&deg;C\r\nHeight: 20.10 cm (7.91\")\r\nWidth: 27.20 cm (10.71\")\r\nDepth: 8.50 cm (3.35\")\r\nForm Factor: Compact/Desktop/Floor/Wall Mountable\r\nWeight (Approximate): 4.90 kg\r\nCountry of Origin: China\r\nLimited Warranty: 2 Year",
