        "name": "Vertiv Liebert GXT MT+ 1kVA/900W 230V Online Standard-Run Transformer-free UPS",
        "fullDescription": "Vertiv Liebert GXT MT+ 1kVA/900W 230V Online Standard-Run Transformer-free UPS - 0.9 Output Power Factor | Graphic LCD| Tower | 2-Year Warranty",
        "longDesc": "0.9 Output Power Factor | Graphic LCD| Tower | 2-Year Warranty",
        "marketing": "The Vertiv Liebert GXT MT+ CX UPS, with a capacity of 1/2/3 kVA, is a compact tower and efficient UPS solution for ensuring the health and availability of IT infrastructure. With online, double conversion technology, the Vertiv Liebert GXT MT+ UPS protects critical equipment against outages and every type of power disturbance without drawing on battery power, extending battery life and minimizing replacements. It comes in standard and long backup models. It has wide input voltage/frequency and better output voltage regulation, which makes it an ideal choice for harsh environments, especially those facing concerns related to unstable mains output and high load impact. This transformer-free UPS, with a fault-tolerant design, ensures continuous availability, while providing clean and consistent power protection in unpredictable environments. This high-performance UPS is ideal for data networks / small-sized data centers/VOIP applications and process automation equipment.",
