        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: GXT53000IRT2UXL\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: Liebert\r\nProduct Series: GXT5\r\nProduct Model: GXT5-3000IRT2UXL\r\nProduct Name: GXT5 UPS - 3000VA/3000W 230V | Online Rack Tower\r\nMarketing Information: The Vertiv Liebert GXT5 UPS 3000VA/3000W, is a 2U UPS solution for ensuring the health and availability of IT infrastructure. With online, double conversion technology, the UPS protects critical equipment against outages and every type of power disturbance without drawing on battery power, extending battery life and minimizing replacements. This can support a wide range of power environment including 200/208/220/230/240V user configurable AC power and has scalable runtime options with matching external battery cabinets to offer extra time during an outage to support critical equipment and activity. It includes hot-swappable batteries and all hardware for installing it as a tower or in an equipment rack. This single-phase UPS is ENERGY STAR&reg; 2.0 certified and offers leading normal mode power efficiency and Eco-mode for ultimate efficiency levels. It has a three-year factory warranty. It offers premium power protection for critical infrastructure in centralized and edge applications.\r\nProduct Condition: New\r\nProduct Type: Double Conversion Online UPS\r\nReceptacle Type: IEC 60320 C19, IEC 60320 C13\r\nReceptacle Detail: 1 x IEC 60320 C19, 6 x IEC 60320 C13\r\nProtection Type: Fuse, Output Over Voltage, Brownout, Dataline Surge, RFI, Surge, Under Voltage, Black Out, No Load, Power Failure, Output Short Circuit, Over Charge, Harmonics, Noise, Short Circuit, Thermal Overload, Deep Discharge, Soft Start, Over Temperature, Over Loading, Inrush Current, EMI, AC Noise, Sag, Electric Shock, Lightning, Temperature, Transient, Discharge, Quad, Output Over Current, Low Battery, High/Low Voltage, Over Current, Electronic Current Limit, Under Current, Line Noise, EMI / RFI, Over Voltage, Spike, AC Surge, Over Power, Excessive Low Battery\r\nCord Length: 3.05 m (120\")\r\nTransfer Time: 0 ns\r\nEMI/RFI Noise Filter: Yes\r\nPhase: Single Phase\r\nApplication/Usage: Mission Critical Equipment, Edge Computing, Network Workstation, Server, Network Closet, Large Network Peripheral, VoIP\r\nLoad Capacity (VA): 3 kVA\r\nLoad Capacity (Watt): 3 kW\r\nInput Voltage: 230 V AC\r\nInput Voltage Range: 115 V AC - 288 V AC\r\nOutput Voltage: 200 V AC, 208 V AC, 220 V AC, 230 V AC, 240 V AC\r\nInput Frequency: 70 Hz\r\nWaveform Type: Pure Sine Wave\r\nCircuit Breaker: Yes\r\nNetwork Management: SNMP/HTTP Remote Monitoring\r\nStatus Indicators: <b>Colored Graphic LCD Display:</b><br /> <ul> <li>UPS status</li> <li>UPS configuration</li> </ul>\r\nSerial Port: Yes\r\nVGA: No\r\nModem (RJ-11): No\r\nNetwork (RJ-45): Yes\r\nUSB (HID Compliant) Port: Yes\r\nDC System Voltage: 72 V DC\r\nNumber of Batteries: 6\r\nBattery Characteristics: Valve-regulated, Non-spillable\r\nBattery Chemistry: Lead Acid\r\nBattery Size: 12V\r\nBattery Capacity: 9000 mAh\r\nBackup/Run Time (Full Load): 3.30 Minute\r\nBackup/Run Time (Half Load): 10.80 Minute\r\nBattery Life: 5 Year\r\nTypical Battery Recharge Time: 3 Hour\r\nHot Pluggable: Yes\r\nHot Swappable: Yes\r\nReplaceable Battery: Yes\r\nMaximum Operating Temperature: 40&deg;C\r\nStorage Temperature: -15&deg;C - 40&deg;C\r\nMaximum Operating Elevation: 3 km (118110.24\")\r\nSound Emission: 48 dB\r\nColor Family: Black\r\nProduct Color: Black\r\nHeight: 8.50 cm (3.35\")\r\nWidth: 43 cm (16.93\")\r\nDepth: 54 cm (21.26\")\r\nRack Height: 2U\r\nForm Factor: Rack/Tower\r\nWeight (Approximate): 28.50 kg\r\nEnergy Star: Yes\r\nTAA Compliant: No",
