        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: GXT51000IRT2UXL\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: Liebert\r\nProduct Series: GXT5\r\nProduct Model: GXT5-1000IRT2UXL\r\nProduct Name: GXT5-1000IRT2UXL 1000VA Rack/Tower UPS\r\nMarketing Information: The Vertiv Liebert GXT5 UPS, with a capacity of 1000VA / 1000W, is a 2U compact and efficient UPS solution for ensuring the health and availability of IT infrastructure. With online, double conversion technology, the Vertiv Liebert GXT5 UPS protects critical equipment against outages and every type of power disturbance without drawing on battery power, extending battery life and minimizing replacements. This can support as wide range of power environment including 200/208/220/230/240VAC power and has scalable runtime options with matching external battery cabinets to offer extra time during an outage to support critical equipment and activity. The UPS design includes hot-swappable batteries and all hardware for installing it as a tower or in an equipment rack. This single-phase UPS is ENERGY STAR&reg; 2.0 certified and offers leading normal mode power efficiency and Eco-mode for ultimate efficiency levels.\r\nProduct Type: Double Conversion Online UPS\r\nReceptacle Type: IEC 60320 C13\r\nReceptacle Detail: 8 x IEC 60320 C13\r\nEMI/RFI Noise Filter: Yes\r\nPhase: Single Phase\r\nApplication/Usage: IT Infrastructure, Business, Network Workstation, Network Closet, Server, Large Network Peripheral, VoIP, Commercial, Industry, Mission Critical Equipment, Computer System, Data Center, Communication System\r\nLoad Capacity (VA): 1 kVA\r\nLoad Capacity (Watt): 1 kW\r\nInput Voltage: 230 V AC\r\nOutput Voltage: 200 V AC, 208 V AC, 220 V AC, 230 V AC, 240 V AC\r\nInput Frequency: 70 Hz\r\nOutput Frequency: 60 Hz\r\nWaveform Type: Sine Wave\r\nNetwork Management: SNMP/HTTP Remote Monitoring\r\nSerial Port: Yes\r\nUSB (HID Compliant) Port: Yes\r\nDC System Voltage: 36 V DC\r\nNumber of Batteries: 3\r\nBattery Characteristics: Valve-regulated, Non-spillable\r\nBattery Chemistry: Lead Acid\r\nBattery Size: 12V\r\nBattery Capacity: 9000 mAh\r\nBackup/Run Time (Full Load): 6 Minute\r\nBackup/Run Time (Half Load): 15 Minute\r\nReplaceable Battery: Yes\r\nEnvironmental Sensors: Temperature Sensor, Humidity Sensor, Leak Detection Sensor\r\nMaximum Operating Temperature: 40&deg;C\r\nStorage Temperature: -15&deg;C - 40&deg;C\r\nMaximum Operating Elevation: 3 km (118110.24\")\r\nHeight: 8.50 cm (3.35\")\r\nWidth: 43 cm (16.93\")\r\nDepth: 40 cm (15.75\")\r\nRack Height: 2U\r\nForm Factor: Rack/Tower\r\nWeight (Approximate): 16.50 kg\r\nEnergy Star: Yes",
