        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: EDGE-750IMT\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: VERTIV\r\nProduct Line: EDGE\r\nProduct Model: EDGE-750IMT\r\nProduct Name: EDGE-750IMT 750VA Tower UPS\r\nMarketing Information: The Vertiv Edge uninterruptible power supply (UPS) is designed to protect server and networking equipment in distributed and Edge IT applications. This 750VA UPS mini-tower offers reliable protection from downtime and damage caused by power spikes, swells and brownouts. Automatic Voltage Regulation (AVR) extends battery life and safeguards critical equipment. With sine wave output, this line interactive UPS ensures availability of network closets and Edge data centers. It operates at up to 98% efficiency in normal operation mode, providing energy savings. Add optional Vertiv Intellislot SNMP/Webcards for remote power management and OS's shutdown with free Vertiv Power Assist software. The Edge family has a wide range of power ratings, from 500VA up to 3000VA and is available in multiple form factors: mini-tower, 1U rack and rack/tower. It is easy to install, configure and operate and comes with intuitive, color LCD screen. It has a standard 3-year Vertiv UPS warranty.\r\nProduct Type: Line-interactive UPS\r\nAVR: Yes\r\nPlug/Connector Type: IEC 60320 C14\r\nReceptacle Type: IEC 60320 C13\r\nReceptacle Detail: 5 x IEC 60320 C13\r\nTransfer Time: 6 ms\r\nPhase: Single Phase\r\nApplication/Usage: Critical System, IT Equipment, Network, IOT Device, Server, Business, Data Center, Data Storage, Electronic, Edge Computing\r\nLoad Capacity (VA): 750 VA\r\nLoad Capacity (Watt): 675 W\r\nInput Voltage: 230 V AC\r\nInput Voltage Range: 166 V AC - 278 V AC\r\nOutput Voltage: 200 V AC, 208 V AC, 220 V AC, 230 V AC, 240 V AC\r\nInput Frequency: 65 Hz\r\nWaveform Type: Sine Wave\r\nSurge Energy Rating: 624 J\r\nNetwork Management: SNMP/Webcard\r\nEPO Port: Yes\r\nUSB (HID Compliant) Port: Yes\r\nDC System Voltage: 24 V DC\r\nNumber of Batteries: 2\r\nBattery Characteristics: Valve-regulated, Non-spillable\r\nBattery Chemistry: Lead Acid\r\nBattery Size: 12V\r\nBattery Capacity: 9000 mAh\r\nBackup/Run Time (Full Load): 5.90 Minute\r\nBackup/Run Time (Half Load): 17 Minute\r\nNumber of External Battery Cabinets: 6\r\nTypical Battery Recharge Time: 3 Hour\r\nMaximum Operating Temperature: 40&deg;C\r\nStorage Temperature: -25&deg;C - 55&deg;C\r\nMaximum Operating Elevation: 3 km (118110.24\")\r\nHeight: 22 cm (8.66\")\r\nWidth: 14.50 cm (5.71\")\r\nDepth: 37 cm (14.57\")\r\nRack Height: 1U\r\nForm Factor: Tower\r\nWeight (Approximate): 11 kg\r\nPackage Contents: <ul><li>EDGE-750IMT 750VA Tower UPS</li><li>USB Cable</li><li>Printed Quick Installation And Guide Safety Instructions</li><li>Adjustable 4-post Rack Mounting Kit </li><li>Support Base For Tower Configuration</li><li>Input And Output Power Cables </li></ul>\r\nSoftware Included: Power Assist\r\nEnvironmentally Friendly: Yes\r\nEnvironmental Compliance: Registration, Evaluation, Authorization and Restriction of Chemicals (REACH), Restriction of Hazardous Substances (RoHS)\r\nLimited Warranty: 2 Year",
