        "techSpecsHtml": "<div id=\"detailSpec\"><h4>General Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Manufacturer</td><td>Vertiv</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Part Number</td><td>504900339000</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Website Address</td><td>http://www.vertiv.com/</td></tr><tr><td>Brand Name</td><td>Liebert</td></tr><tr><td>Product Series</td><td>ITA2</td></tr><tr><td>Product Name</td><td>ITA2 3kVA Rack/tower UPS</td></tr><tr><td>Marketing Information</td><td><p>The Vertiv&trade; Liebert&reg; ITA2 (1-3 kVA) series is a transformer-free UPS designed to offer compact, efficient, and reliable power to modern sensitive electronic equipment. With a unity output power factor, the ITA2 matches the needs of modern IT loads, and with its wide input voltage and frequency range, it helps reduce the need for battery intervention, and can help extend battery life. It offers best-in-class efficiency of up to 94% in double conversion mode over a wide range of load conditions which help contribute to OPEX cost savings. The ITA2 features a multi-lingual LCD user interface allowing close control and monitoring of system status and performance. ITA2 has been rigorously tested under extreme conditions like dusty environments, high altitude, very high and low ambient temperatures, and seismic conditions among others. These capabilities make the ITA2 an ideal choice for a wide range of commercial applications.</p></td></tr><tr><td>Product Type</td><td>Double Conversion Online UPS</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Technical Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Receptacle Type</td><td>Terminal Block</td></tr><tr><td>Transfer Time</td><td>0 ns</td></tr><tr><td>Efficiency Detail</td><td><ul><li>98% (ECO Mode)</li><li>94% (Dual Conversion Mode)</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Application/Usage</td><td><ul><li>Critical System</li><li>Commercial</li><li>Computer</li><li>Workstation</li><li>Server Room</li><li>Data Center</li><li>Network Closet</li><li>VoIP</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Surge Suppression</td><td>Yes</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Power Description</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Load Capacity (VA)</td><td>3 kVA</td></tr><tr><td>Load Capacity (Watt)</td><td>3 kW</td></tr><tr><td>Input Voltage</td><td><ul><li>120 V AC</li><li>230 V AC</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Input Voltage Range</td><td><ul><li>176 V AC - 288 V AC</li><li>100 V AC - 176 V AC</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Output Voltage</td><td><ul><li>220 V AC</li><li>230 V AC</li><li>240 V AC</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Input Frequency</td><td><ul><li>50 Hz</li><li>40 Hz</li><li>70 Hz</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Waveform Type</td><td>Sinusoidal</td></tr><tr><td>Input Power Factor</td><td>0.99</td></tr><tr><td>Output Power Factor</td><td>1</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Display & Graphics</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Display</td><td>LCD</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Management</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Network Management</td><td>SNMP/HTTP Remote Monitoring</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Interfaces/Ports</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Network (RJ-45)</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>USB</td><td>Yes</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Battery Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>DC System Voltage</td><td>72 V DC</td></tr><tr><td>Battery Characteristics</td><td>Maintenance-free, Sealed</td></tr><tr><td>Battery Chemistry</td><td>Lead Acid</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Environmental Conditions</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Minimum Operating Temperature</td><td>0&deg;C</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Operating Temperature</td><td>50&deg;C</td></tr><tr><td>Storage Temperature</td><td>-15&deg;C - 40&deg;C</td></tr><tr><td>Storage Relative Humidity</td><td>5% - 95%</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Physical Characteristics</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Height</td><td>8.50 cm (3.35\")</td></tr><tr><td>Width</td><td>43 cm (16.93\")</td></tr><tr><td>Depth</td><td>54 cm (21.26\")</td></tr><tr><td>Rack Height</td><td>2U</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>Rack/Tower</td></tr><tr><td>Weight (Approximate)</td><td>7.10 kg</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Miscellaneous</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Certifications & Standards</td><td><ul><li>  IEC/EN 62040-1:2008+A1:2013</li><li>  Conducted Emission:IEC/EN 62040-2 C2, Harmonic current:IEC/EN 61000-3-2</li><li>  IEC/EN 61000-4-5</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Energy Star</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Environmental Compliance</td><td>Restriction of Hazardous Substances (RoHS)</td></tr><hr></tbody></table>",
