        "name": "Vertiv Liebert ITON ILB UPS | 1000VA | 1 x 26AH inbuilt battery",
        "fullDescription": "Vertiv Liebert ITON ILB UPS | 1000VA | 1 x 26AH inbuilt battery - AVR | Auto charging at Off-mode | Cold start function | Generator compatible | Voltage range 140-300 VAC | Microprocessor | Simulated sine wave",
        "longDesc": "AVR | Auto charging at Off-mode | Cold start function | Generator compatible | Voltage range 140-300 VAC | Microprocessor | Simulated sine wave",
        "marketing": "This Vertiv Liebert&reg; ITON&trade; ILB 1000VA is a cost-effective, line-interactive uninterruptible power supply unit that offers power protection and battery backup for home or small office computers and other critical electronic equipment. Equipped with one 65AH battery, it helps ensure reliable performance even during power disruptions. This generator-compatible UPS has an AVR for voltage stabilization, and a cold start function for emergency power, making it a dependable solution for maintaining your devices' uptime.",
