        "fullDescription": "Vertiv Liebert PDX PX033U Direct Expansion Cooling, Up Flow Direction Cooling, Fixed, Precision Air Conditioning - Fixed Load | Partial Load | Air-cooled | Air Conditioning | Water-cooled | Digital Scroll | Tandem Scroll | Stage Coil | iCOM | Teamwork Mode | Direct Air | Single Circuit",
        "longDesc": "Fixed Load | Partial Load | Air-cooled | Air Conditioning | Water-cooled | Digital Scroll | Tandem Scroll | Stage Coil | iCOM | Teamwork Mode | Direct Air | Single Circuit",
        "marketing": "The Vertiv Liebert PX033U is a direct expansion cooling unit designed for small and medium data centers. This 33kW precision cooling unit has Liebert EC fans 2.0 that helps prolong the lifespan of your critical equipment by protecting them from overheating. The PDX units help optimize server room temperature, which helps reduce the risk of equipment damage from high temperature and humidity. This reduces the need for costly repairs and replacements, helping you save money over time. Each PDX comes with a Vertiv iCOM device designed to manage the operation of PDX units. Connect multiple PDX units in the same room with the facility's ethernet and access multiple units from one screen. To save you time and effort, the iCOM's Teamwork Mode can automatically supervise and adjust the operation of multiple units. The different Freecooling modes helps the PDX adapt to various cooling demands. This helps the PDX suit your scaling and evolving business needs.",
