        "fullDescription": "Vertiv Geist Monitored rPDU - (24) C13 (6) C19 (2) BS1363| 32A| 230V| 2P+E| Red - Vertiv Geist Monitored Rack Power Distribution Unit (PDU) - Data Center Rack Mount PDU| (24) Locking IEC C13| (6) Locking IEC C19| (2) BS1363| 32A| 230V| 2P+E (IP44)| 7.3kW capacity| Input Power & breaker level monitoring| Daisy chain ethernet connectivity| High visibility LED| Red Coat",
        "longDesc": "Vertiv Geist Monitored Rack Power Distribution Unit (PDU) - Data Center Rack Mount PDU| (24) Locking IEC C13| (6) Locking IEC C19| (2) BS1363| 32A| 230V| 2P+E (IP44)| 7.3kW capacity| Input Power & breaker level monitoring| Daisy chain ethernet connectivity| High visibility LED| Red Coat",
        "marketing": "The Vertiv Geist F0134880 is a 32A, 230V, 0U monitored vertical rack power distribution unit (PDU). It has (20) Locking IEC C13 outlets, (6) Locking IEC C19 outlets, (2) BS1363 outlets, and a 2P+E (IP44) plug providing 7.3kW in power capacity. This Monitored Data Center rPDU provides you quick access to critical power usage information so you can evaluate energy usage trends and maximize uptime. The hot-swappable Interchangeable Monitoring Device displays current on the local LED display. Visible Light Communication technology allows you to view complete power usage data locally from a mobile device with the Vertiv rPDU Scanner app. Patented U-Lock technology help lessen the risk of accidental plug disconnection and downtime. Each rack mount PDU undergoes individual testing for functionality to ensure your network is powered by a reliable smart power strip. It comes with a three-year warranty that can be extended to five-years if registered within 120 days of purchase.",
