        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: F0134879\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: Geist\r\nProduct Series: rPDU\r\nProduct Name: rPDU 30-Outlets PDU\r\nMarketing Information: The Vertiv Geist FO134879 is a 32A, 230V, 0U monitored vertical rack power distribution unit (PDU). It has (24) locking IEC C13 outlets, (6) locking IEC C19 outlets, (2) BS1363 outlets, and a 2P+E (IP44) plug providing 7.3kW in power capacity. This Monitored Data Center rPDU provides you quick access to critical power usage information so you can evaluate energy usage trends and maximize uptime. The hot-swappable Interchangeable Monitoring Device displays current on the local LED display. Visible Light Communication technology allows you to view complete power usage data locally from a mobile device with the Vertiv rPDU Scanner app. Patented U-Lock technology help lessen the risk of accidental plug disconnection and downtime. Each rack mount PDU undergoes individual testing for functionality to ensure your network is powered by a reliable smart power strip. It comes with a three-year warranty that can be extended to five-years if registered within 120 days of purchase.\r\nProduct Type: PDU\r\nPDU Type: Monitored\r\nPhase: Single Phase\r\nPlug/Connector Type: 2P+E (IP44)\r\nPlug/Connector Detail: 1 x 2P+E (IP44)\r\nReceptacle Type: IEC 60320 C13, IEC 60320 C19, BS 1363\r\nReceptacle Detail: 24 x U-Lock IEC 60320 C13, 6 x U-Lock IEC 60320 C19, 2 x BS 1363\r\nLocking Receptacles: IEC 60320 C13, IEC 60320 C19\r\nPower Rating (Watt): 7.30 kW\r\nColor Family: Blue\r\nProduct Color: Blue\r\nMounting Orientation: Vertical\r\nMount Type: Rack-mountable\r\nForm Factor: Vertical\r\nRack Height: 0U\r\nLimited Warranty: 5 Year\r\nAdditional Warranty Information: <p>Three-year warranty is extendable to five years if unit is registered within 120 days of purchase</p>",
