        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: 526600033029\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: Liebert\r\nProduct Series: GXT MT+\r\nProduct Model: GXT MT+ EX 3 kVA\r\nProduct Name: GXT MT+ EX 3 kVA Tower UPS\r\nMarketing Information: <p>The Vertiv Liebert GXT MT+ EX uninterruptible power supply (UPS), with a capacity of 3kVA, is a compact and efficient UPS solution to help ensure the health and availability of IT infrastructure. With online, double conversion technology, the long run Vertiv Liebert GXT MT+ EX UPS protects critical equipment against outages and every type of power disturbance without drawing on battery power, extending battery life and minimizing replacements. This UPS satisfies safety criteria and electromagnetic compatibility standards while offering intelligent monitoring and network management functions. It comes in standard and long backup models. This high-performance UPS is ideal for data networks / small-sized data centers/VOIP applications and process automation equipment. With proven reliability, it is suited for critical applications in banking, financial and insurance, education, government, healthcare, retail and wholesale and telecom industries.</p>\r\nProduct Type: Double Conversion Online UPS\r\nTransfer Time: 4 ms\r\nPhase: Single Phase\r\nEfficiency Detail: 92% (Online Mode), 90% (AC Mode)\r\nApplication/Usage: IT Infrastructure, Mission Critical Equipment, Data Center, Network, VoIP, Process Automation Equipment, Banking, Financial, Insurance, Education, Government, Healthcare, Retail & Wholesale, Telecommunication, Workstation, Server Room, Network Closet\r\nSurge Suppression: Yes\r\nLoad Capacity (VA): 3 kVA\r\nLoad Capacity (Watt): 2.70 kW\r\nInput Voltage: 230 V AC\r\nInput Voltage Range: 110 V AC - 280 V AC\r\nOutput Voltage: 208 V AC, 220 V AC, 230 V AC, 240 V AC\r\nInput Frequency: 40 Hz, 70 Hz\r\nOutput Frequency: 47 Hz, 53 Hz, 57 Hz, 63 Hz, 50 Hz, 60 Hz\r\nInput Frequency Converter: Yes\r\nWaveform Type: Pure Sine Wave\r\nInput Power Factor: 0.99\r\nOutput Power Factor: 0.9\r\nDisplay: LCD\r\nNetwork Management: Smart RS-232/USB\r\nAlarm: Battery Mode, Low Battery, Overload, Fault\r\nStatus Indicators: <p><b>LCD Panel:</b></p><ul><li>  UPS status</li><li>  Load Level</li><li>  Battery Level</li><li>  Input/Output Voltage</li><li>  Discharge Timer</li><li>  Fault Conditions</li></ul>\r\nSerial Port: Yes\r\nNetwork (RJ-45): Yes\r\nUSB: Yes\r\nBattery Characteristics: External Battery System\r\nTypical Battery Recharge Time: 4 Hour\r\nMinimum Operating Temperature: 0&deg;C\r\nMaximum Operating Temperature: 50&deg;C\r\nOperating Humidity: 20% - 90%\r\nHeight: 22 cm (8.66\")\r\nWidth: 14.50 cm (5.71\")\r\nDepth: 39.70 cm (15.63\")\r\nForm Factor: Tower\r\nWeight (Approximate): 7.40 kg",
