        "name": "Vertiv Liebert S600D UPS 20 kVA (3x1) with inbuilt phase reversal correction",
        "fullDescription": "Vertiv Liebert S600D UPS 20 kVA (3x1) with inbuilt phase reversal correction - Three In One Out | Fully digital | Double Conversion | Compact Efficient Robust UPS for Critical Applications | Built-in Ethernet port | Compatibility with intelligent cards | SIC card RDU_SIC | LI-ion battery compatible | Integrated SNMP for monitoring | LCD display",
        "longDesc": "Three In One Out | Fully digital | Double Conversion | Compact Efficient Robust UPS for Critical Applications | Built-in Ethernet port | Compatibility with intelligent cards | SIC card RDU_SIC | LI-ion battery compatible | Integrated SNMP for monitoring | LCD display",
        "marketing": "The Vertiv Liebert S600D 20 kVA is a fully digital, highly reliable, double-conversion UPS solution that provides clean and consistent power. This highly efficient solution is ideal for various deployments, including IT racks, network closets, automation control systems, and precision instruments to small sized control rooms among other edge applications. Its cutting-edge design enables seamless integration into various ecosystems. This UPS offers economical three-phase input, single output power for critical loads. It is tailored for global deployment in a low carbon, compact footprint. This efficient UPS offers up to 91% efficiency over a wide range of load conditions that may contribute to OPEX cost savings. The integrated Smart Sleep technology in ECO mode provides a superlative efficiency of up to 94%. With rackmount or tower configuration, it is easy to install and operate.",
