        "techSpecsHtml": "<div id=\"detailSpec\"><h4>General Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Manufacturer</td><td>Vertiv</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Part Number</td><td>505102079002</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Website Address</td><td>http://www.vertiv.com/</td></tr><tr><td>Brand Name</td><td>Liebert</td></tr><tr><td>Product Model</td><td>S600D</td></tr><tr><td>Product Name</td><td>S600D 20kVA Rack/tower UPS</td></tr><tr><td>Marketing Information</td><td><p>The Vertiv Liebert S600D 20 kVA is a fully digital, highly reliable, double-conversion UPS solution that provides clean and consistent power. This highly efficient solution is ideal for various deployments, including IT racks, network closets, automation control systems, and precision instruments to small sized control rooms among other edge applications. Its cutting-edge design enables seamless integration into various ecosystems. This UPS offers economical three-phase input, single output power for critical loads. It is tailored for global deployment in a low carbon, compact footprint. This efficient UPS offers up to 91% efficiency over a wide range of load conditions that may contribute to OPEX cost savings. The integrated Smart Sleep technology in ECO mode provides a superlative efficiency of up to 94%. With rackmount or tower configuration, it is easy to install and operate.</p></td></tr><tr><td>Product Type</td><td>Double Conversion Online UPS</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Technical Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Plug/Connector Type</td><td>Hard Wire 4-wire</td></tr><tr><td>Transfer Time</td><td>0 ns</td></tr><tr><td>Phase</td><td>Single Phase/Three Phase</td></tr><tr><td>Application/Usage</td><td><ul><li>IT Rack</li><li>Network Closet</li><li>Automation System</li><li>Precision Instrument</li><li>Control Room</li><li>Critical System</li><li>Data Center</li><li>Server</li><li>Workstation</li><li>Telecommunication</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Efficiency</td><td>91%</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Power Description</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Load Capacity (VA)</td><td>20 kVA</td></tr><tr><td>Load Capacity (Watt)</td><td>20 kW</td></tr><tr><td>Input Voltage</td><td><ul><li>380 V AC</li><li>400 V AC</li><li>415 V AC</li><li>120 V AC</li><li>230 V AC</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Input Voltage Range</td><td>100 V AC - 288 V AC</td></tr><tr><td>Output Voltage</td><td><ul><li>220 V AC</li><li>230 V AC</li><li>240 V AC</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Input Frequency</td><td><ul><li>50 Hz</li><li>60 Hz</li><li>40 Hz</li><li>70 Hz</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Input Power Factor</td><td>0.95</td></tr><tr><td>Output Power Factor</td><td>1</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Display & Graphics</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Display</td><td>LCD</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Management</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Network Management</td><td><ul><li>Intelligent Card Slot</li><li>Smart RS-232/USB</li><li>Web/SNMP</li></ul></td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Interfaces/Ports</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Network (RJ-45)</td><td>Yes</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Battery Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Number of Batteries</td><td>32</td></tr><tr><td>Battery Characteristics</td><td>Valve-regulated/Sealed/Maintenance-free</td></tr><tr><td>Battery Chemistry</td><td><ul><li>Lithium Ion (Li-Ion)</li><li>Lead Acid</li></ul></td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Environmental Conditions</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Maximum Operating Temperature</td><td>50&deg;C</td></tr><tr><td>Storage Relative Humidity</td><td>5% - 95%</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Physical Characteristics</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Color Family</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Product Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>Rack/Tower</td></tr><tr><td>Height</td><td>1.30 m (51.18\")</td></tr><tr><td>Width</td><td>33.50 cm (13.19\")</td></tr><tr><td>Depth</td><td>65 cm (25.59\")</td></tr><tr><td>Weight (Approximate)</td><td>175 kg</td></tr><hr></tbody></table>",
