        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: 516300139900\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: Liebert\r\nProduct Line: itON\r\nProduct Model: 1000VA ILB\r\nProduct Name: itON 1000VA ILB Tower UPS\r\nMarketing Information: This Vertiv Liebert&reg; ITON&trade; ILB 1000VA is a cost-effective, line-interactive uninterruptible power supply unit that offers power protection and battery backup for home or small office computers and other critical electronic equipment. Equipped with one 65AH battery, it helps ensure reliable performance even during power disruptions. This generator-compatible UPS has an AVR for voltage stabilization, and a cold start function for emergency power, making it a dependable solution for maintaining your devices' uptime.\r\nProduct Type: Line-interactive UPS\r\nAVR: Yes\r\nOverload Protection: Yes\r\nTransfer Time: 8 ms\r\nApplication/Usage: Generator, Home, Office, Computer, Electronic Equipment\r\nFeatures: Cold Start Function, Auto Restart, Audible Alarm\r\nLoad Capacity (VA): 1 kVA\r\nLoad Capacity (Watt): 600 W\r\nInput Voltage: 120 V AC, 230 V AC\r\nInput Voltage Range: 140 V AC - 300 V AC\r\nInput Frequency: 50 Hz\r\nOutput Frequency: 50 Hz\r\nWaveform Type: Simulated Sine Wave\r\nStatus Indicators: <p><b>LED Indicators:</b></p><ul><li>  AC Mode </li><li>  Battery Mode </li><li>  Fault</li></ul>\r\nNumber of Batteries: 1\r\nBattery Characteristics: Maintenance-free, Sealed, Valve-regulated\r\nBattery Chemistry: Lead Acid\r\nBattery Capacity: 65000 mAh\r\nTypical Battery Recharge Time: 8 Hour\r\nMinimum Operating Temperature: 0&deg;C\r\nMaximum Operating Temperature: 40&deg;C\r\nStorage Temperature: -15&deg;C - 50&deg;C\r\nSound Emission: 50 dB\r\nHeight: 49.40 cm (19.45\")\r\nWidth: 22.50 cm (8.86\")\r\nDepth: 40 cm (15.75\")\r\nForm Factor: Tower\r\nWeight (Approximate): 40 kg\r\nCertifications & Standards: <p>IP20</p>",
