        "fullDescription": "Vertiv Cybex SC840 Secure KVM | Single Head | 4 Port| Dual-link DVI-D | NIAP| 4K - Secure Desktop KVM Switches | Secure KVM Switch | NIAP Common Criteria Protection Profile for Peripheral Sharing Switch v3.0 Certified | Secure Keyboard | 4 Port | Secure Isolated Channels | UHD 4K at 60Hz | Unidirectional Optical Data Diodes (UODD) | 3 Year Warranty",
        "longDesc": "Secure Desktop KVM Switches | Secure KVM Switch | NIAP Common Criteria Protection Profile for Peripheral Sharing Switch v3.0 Certified | Secure Keyboard | 4 Port | Secure Isolated Channels | UHD 4K at 60Hz | Unidirectional Optical Data Diodes (UODD) | 3 Year Warranty",
        "marketing": "The Vertiv Cybex SC840 is a 4-port, single-head, dual-link DVI-I video-type, secure desktop KVM switch. This KVM switch offers a proven solution for guarding against desktop cyber intrusion while working efficiently and with a minimum of clutter. These switches enable users to switch between multiple computer resources seamlessly and securely at the push of a button. Not only do the SC800 KVM switches provide high resolution compatibility (up to UHD 4K at 60Hz) but they are also certified to meet the NIAP Common Criteria Protection Profile for Peripheral Sharing Devices ver. 3.0. With a universal port on every unit, the Vertiv Cybex SC800 can use a combination of DP, HDMI, or VDI-D cables without needing additional adaptors. The unidirectional optical data diodes (UODD) helps prevent information leaks, transfer or crosstalk between adjacent ports and filters ultrasonic audio frequencies.",
