        "fullDescription": "Vertiv Cybex SCKM145 Desktop KM Matrix | Secure | 4 Ports | CNS | DPP | UODD - Vertiv SCKM 100 | Desktop KM | Switching Solutions | High-speed charging port | Dedicated Peripheral Port | Multiple Monitor Support and Presets | Managed Copy-Paste | Cursor Navigation Switching | Anti-tampering | Peripheral isolation | NIAP | Common Criteria Protection Profile | Peripheral Sharing Switch v3.0 certification",
        "longDesc": "Vertiv SCKM 100 | Desktop KM | Switching Solutions | High-speed charging port | Dedicated Peripheral Port | Multiple Monitor Support and Presets | Managed Copy-Paste | Cursor Navigation Switching | Anti-tampering | Peripheral isolation | NIAP | Common Criteria Protection Profile | Peripheral Sharing Switch v3.0 certification",
        "marketing": "The Vertiv&trade; Cybex&trade; SCM145H is a 4-port Secure Desktop KVM Matrix with dual HDMI outputs, perfect for securely monitoring and managing multiple computers. Seamlessly switch between up to four networks with a single button or use Cursor Navigation Switching (CNS) to toggle between two networks using your cursor. Easy to set up and use, the Cybex&trade; SCM145H provides a robust dual monitor solution to safeguard against cyber threats. Key security features include Unidirectional Optical Data Diodes (UODD) for one-way data flow, preventing unauthorized access, and protected video display emulators to eliminate potential data leakage. The Dedicated Peripheral Port (DPP) ensures secure connections to USB authentication devices like Smart-card CAC and biometric readers. Tamper-Evident Labels offer clear visual indicators if hardware has been compromised, providing an additional layer of security.",
