                                "The Vertiv&trade; Cybex&trade; SCM145DP high-performance 4-port Secure Desktop KVM Matrix with dual video outputs (DP and HDMI) is ideal for monitoring and managing multiple computers with varying security levels. Switch between up to four networks at the push of a button or switch between two networks with your cursor through the Cursor Navigation Switching (CNS). While easy to setup and use, the Cybex&trade; SCM145DP still offers a proven dual monitor solution for guarding against cyber intrusion at the desktop. With security-focused features, interaction with multiple computers remain secure. The Unidirectional Optical Data Diodes (UODD) has data only flowing in one direction. The protected video display emulators eliminate potential data leakage from display to computer. A Dedicated Peripheral Port (DPP) for a secure connection to external USB authentication devices such as Smart-card CAC or biometric readers. The Temper-Evident Labels indicate whether hardware has been compromised."
