        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: SCM185-001\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: VERTIV\r\nProduct Line: Cybex\r\nProduct Series: SCM 100\r\nProduct Model: SCM185\r\nProduct Name: Cybex SCM 100 SCM185 KVM Switchbox\r\nMarketing Information: The Vertiv&trade; Cybex&trade; SCM185 is an 8-port Secure Desktop KVM Matrix with DVI and HDMI outputs, perfect for environments needing secure monitoring of multiple computers. Effortlessly switch between up to four networks at the push of a button, or use Cursor Navigation Switching (CNS) for seamless toggling between two networks. Despite its user-friendly setup, the Cybex&trade; SCM185 delivers a reliable dual monitor solution to protect against cyber intrusions. Security is paramount, with Unidirectional Optical Data Diodes (UODD) ensuring data flows in only one direction, preventing unauthorized access. Protected video display emulators eliminate potential data leakage, and the Dedicated Peripheral Port (DPP) provides secure connections to USB authentication devices like Smart-card CAC and biometric readers. Tamper-Evident Labels offer visual alerts if hardware has been compromised, adding an extra layer of security.\r\nProduct Type: KVM Switchbox\r\nConnectivity Technology: Wired\r\nNumber of Computers Supported: 8\r\nNumber of Local Users Supported: 2\r\nDevice Type: Secure Desktop KVM\r\nMaximum Video Resolution: 2560 x 1600\r\nUSB: Yes\r\nDVI: Yes\r\nNumber of USB Ports: 19\r\nNumber of DVI Ports: 10\r\nMinimum Operating Temperature: 0&deg;C\r\nMaximum Operating Temperature: 40&deg;C\r\nInput Voltage: 120 V AC, 230 V AC\r\nInput Voltage Range: 100 to 240V AC\r\nFrequency: 50 Hz, 60 Hz\r\nForm Factor: Desktop, Rack-mountable\r\nHeight: 4.32 cm (1.70\")\r\nWidth: 43.94 cm (17.30\")\r\nDepth: 18.54 cm (7.30\")\r\nWeight (Approximate): 2.45 kg\r\nTAA Compliant: Yes\r\nLimited Warranty: 3 Year",
