        "fullDescription": "Vertiv&trade; Cybex&trade; SCM145 Secure Desktop Matrix | Secure | 2 Ports | USB Keyboard | CNS - Vertiv SCKM | Desktop KM | Switching Solutions | Secure Switches | Multiple Monitor Support and Presets | Managed Copy-Paste | Cursor Navigation Switching | Anti-tampering | Peripheral isolation | NIAP | Common Criteria Protection Profile | Peripheral Sharing Switch v3.0 certification",
        "longDesc": "Vertiv SCKM | Desktop KM | Switching Solutions | Secure Switches | Multiple Monitor Support and Presets | Managed Copy-Paste | Cursor Navigation Switching | Anti-tampering | Peripheral isolation | NIAP | Common Criteria Protection Profile | Peripheral Sharing Switch v3.0 certification",
        "marketing": "The Vertiv&trade; Cybex&trade; SCM145 is a high-performance 4-port Secure Desktop KVM Matrix with dual video outputs (DVI and HDMI), ideal for monitoring and managing multiple computers with varying security levels. Switch between four networks at the push of a button or use Cursor Navigation Switching (CNS) for seamless network navigation. Easy to set up and use, the Cybex&trade; SCM145 offers a reliable dual monitor solution to protect against cyber intrusions on the desktop. Security features include Unidirectional Optical Data Diodes (UODD) to ensure one-way data flow, preventing unauthorized access. Protected video display emulators eliminate potential data leakage, while the Dedicated Peripheral Port (DPP) securely connects external USB authentication devices like Smart-card CAC and biometric readers. Tamper-evident labels provide visual indicators if the hardware has been compromised, adding an extra layer of security.",
