        "techSpecsHtml": "<div id=\"detailSpec\"><h4>General Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Manufacturer</td><td>Vertiv</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Part Number</td><td>SC820D-001</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Website Address</td><td>http://www.vertiv.com/</td></tr><tr><td>Brand Name</td><td>Liebert</td></tr><tr><td>Product Line</td><td>Cybex</td></tr><tr><td>Product Series</td><td>SC800</td></tr><tr><td>Product Model</td><td>SC820D</td></tr><tr><td>Product Name</td><td>Cybex SC800 SC820D KVM Switchbox</td></tr><tr><td>Marketing Information</td><td>The Vertiv Cybex SC820D is a 2-port, single-head, DP 1.2 and HDMI 1.4 video-type, secure desktop KVM switch. This KVM switch offers a proven solution for guarding against desktop cyber intrusion while working efficiently and with a minimum of clutter. These switches enable users to switch between multiple computer resources seamlessly and securely at the push of a button. Not only do the SC800 KVM switches provide high resolution compatibility (up to UHD 4K at 60Hz) but they are also certified to meet the NIAP Common Criteria Protection Profile for Peripheral Sharing Devices ver. 3.0. With a universal port on every unit, the Vertiv Cybex SC800 can use a combination of DP, HDMI, or VDI-D cables without needing additional adaptors. The unidirectional optical data diodes (UODD) helps prevent information leaks, transfer or crosstalk between adjacent ports and filters ultrasonic audio frequencies.</td></tr><tr><td>Product Type</td><td>KVM Switchbox</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Technical Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Connectivity Technology</td><td>Wired</td></tr><tr><td>Number of Computers Supported</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>Device Type</td><td>Secure Desktop KVM</td></tr><tr><td>Features</td><td>Intrusion Detection</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Video</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Graphic Mode</td><td>4K</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Interfaces/Ports</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>USB</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>DisplayPort</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Number of USB Ports</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Number of HDMI Ports</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Number of DisplayPorts</td><td>2</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Physical Characteristics</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Miscellaneous</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>TAA Compliant</td><td>Yes</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Warranty</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Limited Warranty</td><td>24 Month</td></tr><hr></tbody></table>",
