        "fullDescription": "VERTIV Cybex SCM 100 SCM185DP KVM Switchbox - TAA Compliant - 8 Computer(s) - 2 Local User(s) - 4K - 3840 x 2160 - 50 Hz, 60 Hz - 19 x USB - 10 x DisplayPort - Desktop, Rack-mountable",
        "longDesc": "8 Computer(s) - 2 Local User(s) - 4K - 3840 x 2160 - 50 Hz, 60 Hz - 19 x USB - 10 x DisplayPort - Desktop, Rack-mountable",
        "marketing": "The Vertiv&trade; Cybex&trade; SCM185DP is an 8-port Secure Desktop KVM Matrix featuring DP and HDMI video outputs, perfect for environments needing secure management of multiple computers. Switch effortlessly between up to four networks with the push of a button or use Cursor Navigation Switching (CNS) for seamless toggling between two networks. Despite its ease of setup, the Cybex&trade; SCM185DP provides a robust dual monitor solution to defend against cyber threats. Key security features include Unidirectional Optical Data Diodes (UODD) for one-way data flow, preventing unauthorized access, and protected video display emulators to eliminate potential data leakage. The Dedicated Peripheral Port (DPP) offers secure connections to USB authentication devices such as Smart-card CAC and biometric readers. Tamper-Evident Labels provide clear visual alerts if hardware is compromised, adding an extra layer of security.",
