        "marketing": "The Vertiv&trade; Avocent SV340D is a high-performance 4-port desktop KVM switch with dual monitor support and DP 1.2 compatibility, designed to simplify and optimize desktop access to your organization's essential business systems. By enabling control of multiple systems and peripherals through a single keyboard, dual monitors, and mouse, the SV340D reduces peripheral clutter and maximizes workspace. Its three front-facing USB 3.0 ports provide easy connectivity for external devices, ensuring fast data transfer and high-speed mobile device charging. Features such as managed copy-and-paste, zero-delay switching via emulation, and multiple USB ports enhance productivity and operational efficiency. The SV340D also supports high-resolution video up to UHD 4K, guaranteeing exceptional image and video quality. Despite its advanced capabilities, this compact console is no larger than a keyboard, making it an ideal solution for optimizing desktop management and enhancing IT performance.",
