        "name": "Vertiv Avocent SV220D Desktop KVM Switch | 2 Ports | DP | USB | Single Monitor",
        "fullDescription": "Vertiv Avocent SV220D Desktop KVM Switch | 2 Ports | DP | USB | Single Monitor - Vertiv SV200 | Desktop KVM | Switching Solutions | Multiple Monitor Support and Presets | Managed Copy-Paste | Ultra HD 4K Resolution | Mobile and Tablet integration | High-definition link",
        "longDesc": "Vertiv SV200 | Desktop KVM | Switching Solutions | Multiple Monitor Support and Presets | Managed Copy-Paste | Ultra HD 4K Resolution | Mobile and Tablet integration | High-definition link",
        "marketing": "The Vertiv&trade; Avocent SV220D is a versatile 2-port desktop KVM switch that supports a single monitor with DP 1.2, designed to streamline your organization's desktop access to critical business systems. By connecting multiple systems and peripherals through a single keyboard, monitor, and mouse, the SV220D minimizes peripheral clutter and maximizes workspace. Its intuitive features, such as managed copy-and-paste, zero-delay switching via emulation, and multiple USB ports, enhance productivity and efficiency. With high-resolution support up to UHD 4K, the SV220D ensures superior image and video quality, making it ideal for demanding IT environments. Despite its advanced capabilities, the SV220D boasts a compact design, fitting all this functionality into a console no larger than a keyboard, making it the perfect solution for optimizing desktop management.",
