        "name": "Vertiv Avocent SV220D Desktop KVM Switch | 4 Ports | DP | USB | Single Monitor",
        "fullDescription": "Vertiv Avocent SV220D Desktop KVM Switch | 4 Ports | DP | USB | Single Monitor - Vertiv SV200 | Desktop KVM | USB Dedicated Peripheral Port | Switching Solutions | Multiple Monitor Support and Presets | Managed Copy-Paste | Ultra HD 4K Resolution | Mobile and Tablet integration | High-definition link",
        "longDesc": "Vertiv SV200 | Desktop KVM | USB Dedicated Peripheral Port | Switching Solutions | Multiple Monitor Support and Presets | Managed Copy-Paste | Ultra HD 4K Resolution | Mobile and Tablet integration | High-definition link",
        "marketing": "The Vertiv&trade; Avocent SV240D is a powerful 4-port desktop KVM switch with DP 1.2 support, designed to simplify access to your organization's essential business systems. By consolidating control of multiple systems and peripherals into a single keyboard, monitor, and mouse setup, the SV240D minimizes desktop clutter and maximizes workspace efficiency. It features three front USB 3.0 ports for seamless connectivity to external devices, ensuring fast data transfer and high-speed charging for mobile devices. With intuitive managed copy-and-paste functionality, zero-delay switching via emulation, and multiple USB ports, the SV240D significantly boosts productivity and operational efficiency. It supports high-resolution video up to UHD 4K, guaranteeing sharp, clear image and video quality. Compact yet powerful, the SV240D fits all these advanced features into a console no larger than a keyboard, making it the ideal solution for optimizing desktop management and enhancing IT performance.",
