        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: SV240D-001\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: AVOCENT\r\nProduct Line: SV\r\nProduct Series: 200\r\nProduct Model: SV240D\r\nProduct Name: SV 200 SV240D KVM Switch\r\nMarketing Information: The Vertiv&trade; Avocent SV240D is a powerful 4-port desktop KVM switch with DP 1.2 support, designed to simplify access to your organization's essential business systems. By consolidating control of multiple systems and peripherals into a single keyboard, monitor, and mouse setup, the SV240D minimizes desktop clutter and maximizes workspace efficiency. It features three front USB 3.0 ports for seamless connectivity to external devices, ensuring fast data transfer and high-speed charging for mobile devices. With intuitive managed copy-and-paste functionality, zero-delay switching via emulation, and multiple USB ports, the SV240D significantly boosts productivity and operational efficiency. It supports high-resolution video up to UHD 4K, guaranteeing sharp, clear image and video quality. Compact yet powerful, the SV240D fits all these advanced features into a console no larger than a keyboard, making it the ideal solution for optimizing desktop management and enhancing IT performance.\r\nProduct Type: KVM Switchbox\r\nConnectivity Technology: Wired\r\nNumber of Computers Supported: 4\r\nNumber of Local Users Supported: 1\r\nDevice Type: Desktop KVM\r\nGraphic Mode: 4K\r\nMaximum Video Resolution: 3840 x 2160\r\nUSB: Yes\r\nUSB Standard: USB 3.0\r\nDisplayPort: Yes\r\nNumber of USB Ports: 13\r\nNumber of DisplayPorts: 5\r\nMinimum Operating Temperature: 0&deg;C\r\nMaximum Operating Temperature: 40&deg;C\r\nInput Current: 1.20 A\r\nInput Voltage Range: 100 to 240V AC\r\nForm Factor: Desktop\r\nHeight: 4.32 cm (1.70\")\r\nWidth: 34.80 cm (13.70\")\r\nDepth: 12.70 cm (5\")\r\nWeight (Approximate): 1.36 kg\r\nTAA Compliant: Yes\r\nLimited Warranty: 3 Year",
