        "mpn": "MPU2032DAC",
        "name": "Vertiv Avocent MPU | MergePoint Unity | 32 Port | KVM over IP | 2 Remote User",
        "fullDescription": "Vertiv Avocent MPU | MergePoint Unity | 32 Port | KVM over IP | 2 Remote User - Vertiv Avocent MPU | KVM over IP Switches | Smart Card Support (CAC) | Dual AC Power | Digital VGA | DisplayPort | DVI | HDMI | Virtual Media | Mouse synchronization | KVM Session Sharing | Built-in Web Interface | 2-Year Full Coverage Factory Warranty - Optional Extended Warranty Available",
        "longDesc": "Vertiv Avocent MPU | KVM over IP Switches | Smart Card Support (CAC) | Dual AC Power | Digital VGA | DisplayPort | DVI | HDMI | Virtual Media | Mouse synchronization | KVM Session Sharing | Built-in Web Interface | 2-Year Full Coverage Factory Warranty - Optional Extended Warranty Available",
        "marketing": "The Vertiv Avocent MergePoint Unity (MPU) MPU2032AC is a KVM over IP and Serial Console Switch that combines analog (such as access cables) and digital technology (such as interface modules) for flexible, centralized control of data center servers and virtual media. This switch has 32 KVM target ports, dual AC power supply, 2 digital KVM path, and is TAA compliant. The IP-based system facilitates the operation, activation, and maintenance of remote branch offices or other devices found in data centers where trained operators may not be available.The Vertiv Avocent MPU switch enhances the in-band management typically done through the NIC of IT equipment by providing secure and remote out-of-band connections directly to the physical KVM, USB, and serial ports. This unified approach enables IT administrators a faster method to diagnose, reconfigure, or restore equipment to minimize downtime.",
