        "id": "1082583129",
        "mpn": "SV240-001",
        "name": "Vertiv Avocent SV220 Desktop KVM Switch | 4 Ports | DVI-I | USB | Single Monitor",
        "fullDescription": "Vertiv Avocent SV220 Desktop KVM Switch | 4 Ports | DVI-I | USB | Single Monitor - Vertiv SV200 | Desktop KVM | USB Dedicated Peripheral Port | Switching Solutions | Multiple Monitor Support and Presets | Managed Copy-Paste | Ultra HD 4K Resolution | Mobile and Tablet integration | High-definition link",
        "longDesc": "Vertiv SV200 | Desktop KVM | USB Dedicated Peripheral Port | Switching Solutions | Multiple Monitor Support and Presets | Managed Copy-Paste | Ultra HD 4K Resolution | Mobile and Tablet integration | High-definition link",
        "marketing": "The Vertiv&trade; Avocent SV240 is a robust 4-port desktop KVM switch with DVI support, designed to streamline access to your organization's critical business systems. By allowing control of multiple systems and peripherals using a single keyboard, monitor, and mouse, the SV240 reduces clutter and optimizes workspace. Featuring three front-facing USB 3.0 ports, it provides easy connectivity for external devices, enabling quick data transfers and high-speed mobile device charging. The SV240's intuitive features, such as managed copy-and-paste and zero-delay switching via emulation, boost productivity and efficiency. It supports high-resolution video up to UHD 4K, ensuring superior image and video quality without compromising performance. Despite its powerful capabilities, the SV240 is compact, fitting all this functionality into a console no larger than a keyboard, making it the perfect solution for efficient desktop management and IT operations.",
