        "features": [
            "Supports DVI-I with 4-port, single-head model, delivering up to UHD 4K high-resolution output",
            "Enjoy fast data transfer and high-speed charging of mobile devices with three front USB 3.0 ports",
            "Instant emulation ensures zero-delay mouse and keyboard switching between systems for seamless control.",
            "Easily transfer files and text between systems with managed copy-and-paste functionality.",
            "Provides support for resolutions up to UHD 4K - 3840x2160 @30Hz for high-quality output"
        ],
        "techSpecsHtml": "<div id=\"detailSpec\"><h4>General Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Manufacturer</td><td>Vertiv</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Part Number</td><td>SV240-001</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Website Address</td><td>http://www.vertiv.com/</td></tr><tr><td>Brand Name</td><td>AVOCENT</td></tr><tr><td>Product Line</td><td>SV</td></tr><tr><td>Product Series</td><td>200</td></tr><tr><td>Product Model</td><td>SV220</td></tr><tr><td>Product Name</td><td>SV 200 SV240 KVM Switch</td></tr><tr><td>Marketing Information</td><td>The Vertiv&trade; Avocent SV240 is a robust 4-port desktop KVM switch with DVI support, designed to streamline access to your organization's critical business systems. By allowing control of multiple systems and peripherals using a single keyboard, monitor, and mouse, the SV240 reduces clutter and optimizes workspace. Featuring three front-facing USB 3.0 ports, it provides easy connectivity for external devices, enabling quick data transfers and high-speed mobile device charging. The SV240's intuitive features, such as managed copy-and-paste and zero-delay switching via emulation, boost productivity and efficiency. It supports high-resolution video up to UHD 4K, ensuring superior image and video quality without compromising performance. Despite its powerful capabilities, the SV240 is compact, fitting all this functionality into a console no larger than a keyboard, making it the perfect solution for efficient desktop management and IT operations.</td></tr><tr><td>Product Type</td><td>KVM Switchbox</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Technical Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Connectivity Technology</td><td>Wired</td></tr><tr><td>Number of Computers Supported</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Number of Local Users Supported</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Device Type</td><td>Desktop KVM</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Video</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Graphic Mode</td><td>4K</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Video Resolution</td><td>3840 x 2160</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Interfaces/Ports</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>USB</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>USB Standard</td><td>USB 3.0</td></tr><tr><td>DVI</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Number of USB Ports</td><td>13</td></tr><tr><td>Number of DVI Ports</td><td>5</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Environmental Conditions</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Minimum Operating Temperature</td><td>0&deg;C</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Operating Temperature</td><td>40&deg;C</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Power Description</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Input Current</td><td>1.50 A</td></tr><tr><td>Input Voltage Range</td><td>100 to 240V</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Physical Characteristics</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop</td></tr><tr><td>Height</td><td>4.32 cm (1.70\")</td></tr><tr><td>Width</td><td>34.80 cm (13.70\")</td></tr><tr><td>Depth</td><td>12.70 cm (5\")</td></tr><tr><td>Weight (Approximate)</td><td>1.36 kg</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Miscellaneous</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>TAA Compliant</td><td>Yes</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Warranty</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Limited Warranty</td><td>3 Year</td></tr><hr></tbody></table>",
