        "name": "Vertiv Avocent SV340H Desktop KVM Switch | 4 Ports | HDMI | USB | Dual Monitor",
        "fullDescription": "Vertiv Avocent SV340H Desktop KVM Switch | 4 Ports | HDMI | USB | Dual Monitor - Vertiv SV300 | Desktop KVM | Switching Solutions | Multiple Monitor Support and Presets | Managed Copy-Paste | Ultra HD 4K Resolution | Mobile and Tablet integration | High-definition link",
        "longDesc": "Vertiv SV300 | Desktop KVM | Switching Solutions | Multiple Monitor Support and Presets | Managed Copy-Paste | Ultra HD 4K Resolution | Mobile and Tablet integration | High-definition link",
        "marketing": "The Vertiv&trade; Avocent SV340H is a versatile 4-port desktop KVM switch with dual monitor support and HDMI compatibility, designed to streamline and enhance access to your organization's critical business systems. By consolidating control of multiple systems and peripherals into a single keyboard, dual monitors, and mouse setup, the SV340H reduces clutter and optimizes workspace efficiency. It features three front-facing USB 3.0 ports for seamless connectivity, enabling fast data transfers and high-speed charging for mobile devices. Additionally, the mobile High-Definition Link allows you to view media from mobile devices directly on connected HDMI monitors. With intuitive managed copy-and-paste functionality, zero-delay switching via emulation, and multiple USB ports, the SV340H boosts productivity and operational efficiency. It supports high-resolution video up to UHD 4K, ensuring outstanding image and video quality. Despite its powerful capabilities, the SV340H is compact, fitting all this functionality into a console no larger than a keyboard, making it the perfect solution for optimizing desktop management and enhancing IT performance.",
