        "techSpecsHtml": "<div id=\"detailSpec\"><h4>General Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Manufacturer</td><td>Vertiv</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Part Number</td><td>MPU108EDAC</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Website Address</td><td>http://www.vertiv.com/</td></tr><tr><td>Brand Name</td><td>Liebert</td></tr><tr><td>Product Line</td><td>MergePoint Unity</td></tr><tr><td>Product Name</td><td>MergePoint Unity Switch</td></tr><tr><td>Marketing Information</td><td>The Vertiv Avocent MergePoint Unity (MPU) MPU108EDAC is a KVM over IP and Serial Console Switch that combines analog (such as access cables) and digital technology (such as interface modules) for flexible, centralized control of data center servers and virtual media. This switch has 8 KVM target ports, dual AC power supply, 1 digital KVM path, and is TAA compliant. The IP-based system facilitates the operation, activation, and maintenance of remote branch offices or other devices found in data centers where trained operators may not be available.The Vertiv Avocent MPU switch enhances the in-band management typically done through the NIC of IT equipment by providing secure and remote out-of-band connections directly to the physical KVM, USB, and serial ports. This unified approach enables IT administrators a faster method to diagnose, reconfigure, or restore equipment to minimize downtime. <br />  <p><br /></p></td></tr><tr><td>Product Type</td><td>KVM Switchbox</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Technical Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>KVM Technology</td><td>Digital</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity Technology</td><td>Wired</td></tr><tr><td>Device Type</td><td>KVM over IP</td></tr><tr><td>Features</td><td>Plug and Play</td></tr><tr><td>Remote Management Protocol</td><td>SSH</td></tr><tr><td>Rack Mounting Kit</td><td>Included</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Video</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Maximum Video Resolution</td><td>1920 x 1080</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Interfaces/Ports</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Network (RJ-45)</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>USB</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>USB 2.0</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Number of Network (RJ-45) Ports</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td>Number of USB Ports</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Number of VGA Ports</td><td>1</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Power Description</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Input Current</td><td>1.25 A</td></tr><tr><td>Input Voltage Range</td><td>100-240V</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Physical Characteristics</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>Rack-mountable</td></tr><tr><td>Height</td><td>4.37 cm (1.72\")</td></tr><tr><td>Width</td><td>43.18 cm (17\")</td></tr><tr><td>Depth</td><td>23.37 cm (9.20\")</td></tr><tr><td>Weight (Approximate)</td><td>3.08 kg</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Miscellaneous</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Package Contents</td><td><ul><li>  The MergePoint UnityTM switch</li><li>  Rack mount bracket kit</li><li>  AC power cord(s)</li><li>  Quick installation guide</li></ul><p><br /></p></td></tr><tr><td>TAA Compliant</td><td>Yes</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Warranty</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Limited Warranty</td><td>2 Year</td></tr><hr></tbody></table>",
