        "fullDescription": "Vertiv Avocent SV220 Desktop KVM Switch | 2 Ports | DVI-I | USB | Single Monitor - Vertiv SV200 | Desktop KVM | Switching Solutions | Multiple Monitor Support and Presets | Managed Copy-Paste | Ultra HD 4K Resolution | Mobile and Tablet integration | High-definition link",
        "longDesc": "Vertiv SV200 | Desktop KVM | Switching Solutions | Multiple Monitor Support and Presets | Managed Copy-Paste | Ultra HD 4K Resolution | Mobile and Tablet integration | High-definition link",
        "marketing": "The Vertiv&trade; Avocent SV220 is a powerful and compact 2-port desktop KVM switch designed to enhance productivity and streamline IT management. With support for a single monitor and DVI, this KVM switch allows seamless access to multiple business systems and peripherals through one keyboard, monitor, and mouse setup, reducing the clutter of additional peripherals and saving valuable desktop space. Its user-friendly features include managed copy-and-paste functionality and zero-delay switching between systems, thanks to advanced emulation technology. Multiple USB ports provide connectivity for essential devices, further boosting productivity. The SV220 also delivers exceptional image and video quality, supporting resolutions up to UHD 4K, all within a console that's no bigger than a keyboard. Simplify your desktop environment while maintaining high performance and efficiency with the Vertiv Avocent SV220.",
