        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: CLRA19KMM\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: VERTIV\r\nProduct Model: CLRA19KMM\r\nProduct Name: 18.5\" CLRA Local Rack Access Consoles\r\nMarketing Information: The Vertiv Avocent Center Local Rack Access (CLRA) CLRA19KMM is a 1U, 18.5-inch LCD tray-only console that allows you to view servers, network switches, and other IT equipment immediately without bulky access equipment. These trays feature standard USB and VGA interfaces compatible with a vast number of servers and network devices, eliminating the clutter of crash carts, monitors, and keyboards. These consoles provide the simplicity, efficiency, and ease of use to make it the ideal data center access point. When connected to a KVM switch, the CLRA line enables ease of access to multiple servers, making software upgrades, troubleshooting, and system monitoring convenient and less time-consuming, protecting uptime and staff time. Compatible with all Vertiv Avocent data center KVM switches, the Vertiv Avocent CLRA includes a widescreen LCD console tray and a full desktop-style keyboard with a touchpad. Its minimal power draw during standby and operation saves energy and money.\r\nProduct Type: LCD Rack Console\r\nScreen Size: 46.99 cm (18.50\")\r\nDisplay Screen Type: LCD\r\nScreen Mode: Full HD\r\nScreen Resolution: 1920 x 1080\r\nAspect Ratio: 16:9\r\nKeyboard: Yes\r\nPointing Device Type: TouchPad\r\nUSB: Yes\r\nNumber of USB Ports: 2\r\nInput Voltage: 120 V AC, 230 V AC\r\nRack Height: 1U\r\nHeight: 4.25 cm (1.67\")\r\nWidth: 52.64 cm (20.72\")\r\nDepth: 48.13 cm (18.95\")\r\nWeight (Approximate): 8.30 kg\r\nPackage Contents: <li>18.5\" CLRA Local Rack Access Consoles</li> <li>1 x Standard KVM cable</li>",
