        "fullDescription": "Vertiv Cybex SCKM120 Desktop KM Switch | Secure | 2 Ports | USB Keyboard | CNS - Vertiv SCKM | Desktop KM | Switching Solutions | Secure Switches | Multiple Monitor Support and Presets | Managed Copy-Paste | Cursor Navigation Switching | Anti-tampering | Peripheral isolation | NIAP | Common Criteria Protection Profile | Peripheral Sharing Switch v3.0 certification",
        "longDesc": "Vertiv SCKM | Desktop KM | Switching Solutions | Secure Switches | Multiple Monitor Support and Presets | Managed Copy-Paste | Cursor Navigation Switching | Anti-tampering | Peripheral isolation | NIAP | Common Criteria Protection Profile | Peripheral Sharing Switch v3.0 certification",
        "marketing": "The Vertiv Cybex SCKM120 is a 2-port Secure Desktop KM switch designed to deliver real-time access to critical information while ensuring top-notch security. Ideal for military, government, financial firms, emergency control centers, and any organization with stringent security needs, the SCKM120 provides secure, efficient control over peripherals for specific systems. This switch combines the productivity features of Avocent KM switches, such as zero-delay switching, with advanced security measures. It includes Unidirectional Optical Data Diodes (UODD), an always-on active anti-tampering system, and certification from the NIAP Common Criteria Protection Profile for Peripheral Sharing Switch version 3.0. The SCKM120 is engineered to meet the highest security standards, ensuring both superior performance and protection.",
