        "features": [
            "The 2-port module grants secure access to all required information",
            "Experience zero delay in switching between sources with seamless mouse and keyboard emulation.",
            "Cursor Navigation Switching lets users seamlessly control systems by moving the cursor between displays.",
            "Control access through advanced isolation between computers and shared peripherals",
            "Hardware-based peripheral isolation loads all firmware on ROM with no keyboard buffering or memory"
        ],
        "techSpecsHtml": "<div id=\"detailSpec\"><h4>General Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Manufacturer</td><td>Vertiv</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Part Number</td><td>SCKM120</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Website Address</td><td>http://www.vertiv.com/</td></tr><tr><td>Brand Name</td><td>AVOCENT</td></tr><tr><td>Product Line</td><td>Cybex</td></tr><tr><td>Product Model</td><td>SCKM120</td></tr><tr><td>Product Name</td><td>Cybex SCKM120 KM Switch</td></tr><tr><td>Marketing Information</td><td><p>The Vertiv Cybex SCKM120 is a 2-port Secure Desktop KM switch designed to deliver real-time access to critical information while ensuring top-notch security. Ideal for military, government, financial firms, emergency control centers, and any organization with stringent security needs, the SCKM120 provides secure, efficient control over peripherals for specific systems. This switch combines the productivity features of Avocent KM switches, such as zero-delay switching, with advanced security measures. It includes Unidirectional Optical Data Diodes (UODD), an always-on active anti-tampering system, and certification from the NIAP Common Criteria Protection Profile for Peripheral Sharing Switch version 3.0. The SCKM120 is engineered to meet the highest security standards, ensuring both superior performance and protection. </p></td></tr><tr><td>Product Type</td><td>KM Switchbox</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Technical Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Connectivity Technology</td><td>Wired</td></tr><tr><td>Device Type</td><td>Desktop KM</td></tr><tr><td>Features</td><td>Anti-tamper Switch</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Interfaces/Ports</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>USB</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Number of USB Ports</td><td>4</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Environmental Conditions</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Minimum Operating Temperature</td><td>0&deg;C</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Operating Temperature</td><td>40&deg;C</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Power Description</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Input Current</td><td>1.50 A</td></tr><tr><td>Input Voltage Range</td><td>100 to 240V AC</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Physical Characteristics</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop</td></tr><tr><td>Height</td><td>2.80 cm (1.10\")</td></tr><tr><td>Width</td><td>34.20 cm (13.46\")</td></tr><tr><td>Depth</td><td>12.50 cm (4.92\")</td></tr><tr><td>Weight (Approximate)</td><td>400 g</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Miscellaneous</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>TAA Compliant</td><td>Yes</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Warranty</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Limited Warranty</td><td>3 Year</td></tr><hr></tbody></table>",
