        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: SCKM120\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: AVOCENT\r\nProduct Line: Cybex\r\nProduct Model: SCKM120\r\nProduct Name: Cybex SCKM120 KM Switch\r\nMarketing Information: <p>The Vertiv Cybex SCKM120 is a 2-port Secure Desktop KM switch designed to deliver real-time access to critical information while ensuring top-notch security. Ideal for military, government, financial firms, emergency control centers, and any organization with stringent security needs, the SCKM120 provides secure, efficient control over peripherals for specific systems. This switch combines the productivity features of Avocent KM switches, such as zero-delay switching, with advanced security measures. It includes Unidirectional Optical Data Diodes (UODD), an always-on active anti-tampering system, and certification from the NIAP Common Criteria Protection Profile for Peripheral Sharing Switch version 3.0. The SCKM120 is engineered to meet the highest security standards, ensuring both superior performance and protection. </p>\r\nProduct Type: KM Switchbox\r\nConnectivity Technology: Wired\r\nDevice Type: Desktop KM\r\nFeatures: Anti-tamper Switch\r\nUSB: Yes\r\nNumber of USB Ports: 4\r\nMinimum Operating Temperature: 0&deg;C\r\nMaximum Operating Temperature: 40&deg;C\r\nInput Current: 1.50 A\r\nInput Voltage Range: 100 to 240V AC\r\nForm Factor: Desktop\r\nHeight: 2.80 cm (1.10\")\r\nWidth: 34.20 cm (13.46\")\r\nDepth: 12.50 cm (4.92\")\r\nWeight (Approximate): 400 g\r\nTAA Compliant: Yes\r\nLimited Warranty: 3 Year",
