        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: MPU4032DAC\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: Liebert\r\nProduct Line: MergePoint Unity\r\nProduct Name: MergePoint Unity Switch\r\nMarketing Information: <p>The Vertiv Avocent MergePoint Unity (MPU) MPU4032AC is a KVM over IP and Serial Console Switch that combines analog (such as access cables) and digital technology (such as interface modules) for flexible, centralized control of data center servers and virtual media. This switch has 32 KVM target ports, dual AC power supply, 4 digital KVM path, and is TAA compliant. The IP-based system facilitates the operation, activation, and maintenance of remote branch offices or other devices found in data centers where trained operators may not be available.  The Vertiv Avocent MPU switch enhances the in-band management typically done through the NIC of IT equipment by providing secure and remote out-of-band connections directly to the physical KVM, USB, and serial ports. This unified approach enables IT administrators a faster method to diagnose, reconfigure, or restore equipment to minimize downtime. </p>\r\nProduct Type: KVM Switchbox\r\nKVM Technology: Digital\r\nConnectivity Technology: Wired\r\nDevice Type: KVM over IP\r\nFeatures: Plug and Play\r\nRemote Management Protocol: SSH\r\nRack Mounting Kit: Included\r\nMaximum Video Resolution: 1920 x 1080\r\nNetwork (RJ-45): Yes\r\nUSB: Yes\r\nUSB 2.0: Yes\r\nNumber of Network (RJ-45) Ports: 39\r\nNumber of USB Ports: 5\r\nInput Current: 1.25 A\r\nInput Voltage Range: 100-240V\r\nForm Factor: Rack-mountable\r\nHeight: 4.37 cm (1.72\")\r\nWidth: 43.18 cm (17\")\r\nDepth: 33.99 cm (13.38\")\r\nWeight (Approximate): 3.90 kg\r\nPackage Contents: <ul><li>  The MergePoint UnityTM switch</li><li>  Rack mount bracket kit</li><li>  AC power cord(s)</li><li>  Quick installation guide</li></ul><p><br /></p>\r\nTAA Compliant: Yes\r\nLimited Warranty: 2 Year",
