        "fullDescription": "Vertiv Avocent Center Local Rack Access | CLRA | 1U | Rack Mount | 8-Port KVM Console - Center Local Rack Access | KVM LCD | Integrated | Rackmount Console | 2-Year Full Coverage Factory Warranty - Optional Extended Warranty Available",
        "longDesc": "Center Local Rack Access | KVM LCD | Integrated | Rackmount Console | 2-Year Full Coverage Factory Warranty - Optional Extended Warranty Available",
        "marketing": "The Vertiv Avocent Center Local Rack Access (CLRA) CLRA19KMM8D is a 1U, 18.5-inch LCD console with a pre-integrated, IP-based, 8-port KVM. The CLRA allows you to view servers, network switches, and other IT equipment without bulky access equipment. These trays feature standard USB and VGA interfaces compatible with a vast number of servers and network devices, eliminating the clutter of crash carts, monitors, and keyboards. These consoles provide simplicity, efficiency, and ease of use, making it the ideal data center access point. When connected to a KVM switch, the CLRA line enables access to multiple servers making software upgrades, troubleshooting and system monitoring convenient and less time-consuming, protecting uptime and staff time. Compatible with all Vertiv Avocent data center KVM switches, the CLRA includes a widescreen LCD console tray and full desktop-style keyboard with touchpad. Its minimal power draw during standby and operation saves energy and money.",
