        "techSpecsHtml": "<div id=\"detailSpec\"><h4>General Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Manufacturer</td><td>Vertiv</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Part Number</td><td>CLRA19KMM8D</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer Website Address</td><td>http://www.vertiv.com/</td></tr><tr><td>Brand Name</td><td>VERTIV</td></tr><tr><td>Product Model</td><td>CLRA19KMM8D</td></tr><tr><td>Product Name</td><td>18.5\" CLRA Local Rack Access Consoles</td></tr><tr><td>Marketing Information</td><td>The Vertiv Avocent Center Local Rack Access (CLRA) CLRA19KMM8D is a 1U, 18.5-inch LCD console with a pre-integrated, IP-based, 8-port KVM. The CLRA allows you to view servers, network switches, and other IT equipment without bulky access equipment. These trays feature standard USB and VGA interfaces compatible with a vast number of servers and network devices, eliminating the clutter of crash carts, monitors, and keyboards. These consoles provide simplicity, efficiency, and ease of use, making it the ideal data center access point. When connected to a KVM switch, the CLRA line enables access to multiple servers making software upgrades, troubleshooting and system monitoring convenient and less time-consuming, protecting uptime and staff time. Compatible with all Vertiv Avocent data center KVM switches, the CLRA includes a widescreen LCD console tray and full desktop-style keyboard with touchpad. Its minimal power draw during standby and operation saves energy and money.</td></tr><tr><td>Product Type</td><td>LCD Rack Console</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Technical Information</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>KVM Switch</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Number of Computers Supported</td><td>8</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Display & Graphics</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Screen Size</td><td>46.99 cm (18.50\")</td></tr><tr><td>Display Screen Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>Screen Mode</td><td>Full HD</td></tr><tr><td>Screen Resolution</td><td>1920 x 1080</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Input Devices</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Keyboard</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Pointing Device Type</td><td>TouchPad</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Interfaces/Ports</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>USB</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Number of USB Ports</td><td>2</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Power Description</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Input Voltage</td><td><ul><li>120 V AC</li><li>230 V AC</li></ul></td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Physical Characteristics</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Rack Height</td><td>1U</td></tr><tr><td>Height</td><td>4.25 cm (1.67\")</td></tr><tr><td>Width</td><td>52.64 cm (20.72\")</td></tr><tr><td>Depth</td><td>48.13 cm (18.95\")</td></tr><tr><td>Weight (Approximate)</td><td>8.30 kg</td></tr><hr></tbody></table><h4>Miscellaneous</h4><table><tbody><tr><td>Package Contents</td><td><li>18.5\" CLRA Local Rack Access Consoles</li> <li>1 x Standard KVM cable</li></td></tr><hr></tbody></table>",
