        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: CLRA19KMM8D\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: VERTIV\r\nProduct Model: CLRA19KMM8D\r\nProduct Name: 18.5\" CLRA Local Rack Access Consoles\r\nMarketing Information: The Vertiv Avocent Center Local Rack Access (CLRA) CLRA19KMM8D is a 1U, 18.5-inch LCD console with a pre-integrated, IP-based, 8-port KVM. The CLRA allows you to view servers, network switches, and other IT equipment without bulky access equipment. These trays feature standard USB and VGA interfaces compatible with a vast number of servers and network devices, eliminating the clutter of crash carts, monitors, and keyboards. These consoles provide simplicity, efficiency, and ease of use, making it the ideal data center access point. When connected to a KVM switch, the CLRA line enables access to multiple servers making software upgrades, troubleshooting and system monitoring convenient and less time-consuming, protecting uptime and staff time. Compatible with all Vertiv Avocent data center KVM switches, the CLRA includes a widescreen LCD console tray and full desktop-style keyboard with touchpad. Its minimal power draw during standby and operation saves energy and money.\r\nProduct Type: LCD Rack Console\r\nKVM Switch: Yes\r\nNumber of Computers Supported: 8\r\nScreen Size: 46.99 cm (18.50\")\r\nDisplay Screen Type: LCD\r\nScreen Mode: Full HD\r\nScreen Resolution: 1920 x 1080\r\nAspect Ratio: 16:9\r\nKeyboard: Yes\r\nPointing Device Type: TouchPad\r\nUSB: Yes\r\nNumber of USB Ports: 2\r\nInput Voltage: 120 V AC, 230 V AC\r\nRack Height: 1U\r\nHeight: 4.25 cm (1.67\")\r\nWidth: 52.64 cm (20.72\")\r\nDepth: 48.13 cm (18.95\")\r\nWeight (Approximate): 8.30 kg\r\nPackage Contents: <li>18.5\" CLRA Local Rack Access Consoles</li> <li>1 x Standard KVM cable</li>",
