        "fullDescription": "Vertiv Avocent AV104 KVM Switch | 16 port | Rackmount | Desktop | Single-User | USB | OSD | Touch Button | Hotkey | Cascade | Internal PS | 16 VGA - Vertiv Avocent | AutoView 100 | AV100 | 1x16 | Bundle | Package | DisplayPort | KVM Switch with USB | Small Data Centers | Branch Offices | IT Rooms | 2 Year - Advanced Replacement | Full Coverage Factory Warranty",
