        "marketing": "The Vertiv Avocent AV116BND4 is an AutoView 116 (AV116) bundle that contains a 16-port KVM switch and 8 VGA target (CBL0170) cables. This compact, entry-level solution to local server management for small data centers, branch offices, and IT rooms. The straightforward user experience consists of a basic KVM feature set with simple touch button, hotkey operation, and cascade support. It delivers streamlined local access and control designed to be available when needed with user-friendly features for controlling all devices and tasks. The AV116 KVM switch is available in 1U, 0U, and desktop configurations and is easy to configure and maintain. It offers centralized access, management, and event logging when requirements don't allow remote (IP) connectivity to the server.",
