        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: SVKM120\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: Liebert\r\nProduct Line: Cybex\r\nProduct Series: SVKM 100\r\nProduct Model: SVKM120\r\nProduct Name: Cybex SVKM 100 SVKM120 KM Switchbox\r\nMarketing Information: The Vertiv Avocent SVKM120 is a 2-port Desktop KM switch that helps your organization achieve greater productivity at lower cost. With cursor navigation switching (CNS), zero-delay switching, managed copy and paste, and multiple monitor support and presets, the SVKM120 KM switch streamlines connectivity as a front end to one or more high performance solutions. All this functionality inside a console no bigger than a keyboard and can be easily mounted underneath the desktop.\r\nProduct Type: KM Switchbox\r\nNumber of Computers Supported: 2\r\nNumber of Local Users Supported: 1\r\nDevice Type: Desktop KM\r\nUSB: Yes\r\nNumber of USB Ports: 4\r\nMinimum Operating Temperature: 0&deg;C\r\nMaximum Operating Temperature: 40&deg;C\r\nInput Voltage Range: 100 to 240V AC\r\nForm Factor: Desktop\r\nHeight: 2.54 cm (1\")\r\nWidth: 17.78 cm (7\")\r\nDepth: 6.10 cm (2.40\")\r\nWeight (Approximate): 399.2 g\r\nTAA Compliant: Yes\r\nLimited Warranty: 3 Year",
