        "techSpecs": "Manufacturer: Vertiv\r\nManufacturer Part Number: AV104BND4-400\r\nManufacturer Website Address: http://www.vertiv.com/\r\nBrand Name: AVOCENT\r\nProduct Line: AutoView\r\nProduct Series: AV 100\r\nProduct Model: AV 104BND4-400\r\nProduct Name: AutoView AV 100 AV 104BND4-400 KVM Switchbox\r\nMarketing Information: The Vertiv Avocent AV104BND4 is an AutoView 104 (AV104) bundle that contains a 4-port KVM switch and 4 VGA target (CBL0170) cables. This compact, entry-level solution to local server management for small data centers, branch offices, and IT rooms. The straightforward user experience consists of a basic KVM feature set with simple touch button, hotkey operation, and cascade support. It delivers streamlined local access and control designed to be available when needed with user-friendly features for controlling all devices and tasks. The AV104 KVM switch is available in 1U, 0U, and desktop configurations and is easy to configure and maintain. It offers centralized access, management, and event logging when requirements don't allow remote (IP) connectivity to the server.\r\nPackaged Quantity: 1\r\nProduct Type: KVM Switchbox\r\nKVM Technology: Analog\r\nConnectivity Technology: Wired\r\nNumber of Computers Supported: 4\r\nNumber of Local Users Supported: 1\r\nDevice Type: Rack KVM\r\nMaximum Video Resolution: 2048 x 1536\r\nUSB: Yes\r\nVGA: Yes\r\nDisplayPort: Yes\r\nProprietary Interface: Yes\r\nSerial Port: Yes\r\nNumber of USB Ports: 5\r\nNumber of VGA Ports: 1\r\nNumber of Proprietary Ports: 4\r\nMinimum Operating Temperature: 0&deg;C\r\nMaximum Operating Temperature: 50&deg;C\r\nInput Voltage: 110 V AC, 220 V AC\r\nInput Voltage Range: 100-240V AC\r\nFrequency: 50 Hz, 60 Hz\r\nPower Consumption: 10 W\r\nForm Factor: Desktop, Rack-mountable\r\nRack Height: 1U\r\nHeight: 4.37 cm (1.72\")\r\nWidth: 43.18 cm (17\")\r\nDepth: 12.07 cm (4.75\")\r\nWeight (Approximate): 1.54 kg\r\nLimited Warranty: 2 Year",
